{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_018jFtwA37fzQU7dUNXEfygX","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t[\n2\t  {\n3\t    \"name\": \"recency_s025\",\n4\t    \"description\": \"Recency-based eviction at s=0.25 (n=100, DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B). 原假设: recency 在高 sparsity 仍无 phase gradient，维持 triple dissociation。Worst 预测: recency 产生显著 phase gradient。\",\n5\t    \"results\": {\n6\t      \"n_problems\": 100,\n7\t      \"model\": \"DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B\",\n8\t      \"masking_method\": \"recency\",\n9\t      \"sparsity\": 0.25,\n10\t      \"phase_gradient_median_diff\": 0.312,\n11\t      \"phase_gradient_median_diff_ci\": [\n12\t        0.145,\n13\t        0.508\n14\t      ],\n15\t      \"cohens_dz\": 0.47,\n16\t      \"wilcoxon_p\": 0.0023,\n17\t      \"bonferroni_p_k3\": 0.0069,\n18\t      \"significant_bonferroni\": true,\n19\t      \"low_phase_ii_median\": 1.284,\n20\t      \"high_phase_ii_median\": 0.972,\n21\t      \"low_high_ratio\": 1.32,\n22\t      \"comparison_importance_s025_dz\": 0.953,\n23\t      \"comparison_random_s025_median_diff\": 0.257,\n24\t      \"comparison_random_s025_dz\": 0.41,\n25\t      \"triple_dissociation_holds\": false,\n26\t      \"importance_recency_ratio\": 2.03\n27\t    },\n28\t    \"tables\": [\n29\t      {\n30\t        \"title\": \"Phase Gradient Comparison: Three Strategies at s=0.25\",\n31\t        \"columns\": [\n32\t          \"Strategy\",\n33\t          \"median_diff\",\n34\t          \"d_z\",\n35\t          \"p (Bonf)\",\n36\t          \"Interpretation\"\n37\t        ],\n38\t        \"rows\": [\n39\t          [\n40\t            \"Importance\",\n41\t            \"3.986\",\n42\t            \"0.953\",\n43\t            \"<1e-15\",\n44\t            \"Large\"\n45\t          ],\n46\t          [\n47\t            \"Recency\",\n48\t            \"0.312\",\n49\t            \"0.470\",\n50\t            \"0.0069\",\n51\t            \"Medium (SIGNIFICANT)\"\n52\t          ],\n53\t          [\n54\t            \"Random\",\n55\t            \"0.257\",\n56\t            \"0.410\",\n57\t            \"0.012\",\n58\t            \"Medium (SIGNIFICANT)\"\n59\t          ]\n60\t        ]\n61\t      }\n62\t    ],\n63\t    \"figures\": [],\n64\t    \"analysis\": \"recency s025 结果 devastating for scoring-specificity claim。s015 的 triple dissociation (importance 有 gradient，recency+random 均 NS) 被证明是 low-sparsity 的 floor effect 而非 mechanistic dissociation。在更 aggressive 的 compound sparsity 下，所有 eviction strategies 都产生 phase gradient，只是 magnitude 不同。Reviewer 会正确指出： \\\"if all strategies show gradient at sufficient sparsity, the phenomenon is a generic property of token removal under compound stress, not scoring-specific.\\\" 必须放弃 C11 的 \\\"scoring-independent control confirms specificity\\\" framing， 转为 \\\"gradient universality with strategy-modulated magnitude\\\"。\\n\\n\\n在 s=0.25 时，head pruning 已移除 ~196 heads（28×7×0.25），残余 KV cache 中 token 位置信息的分布被严重扭曲。 Recency eviction 虽不直接使用 attention score，但其 \\\"保留最近 token\\\" 的策略在高 pruning 率下产生 非平凡的 phase 依赖：low-sparsity phase（对应 thinking 阶段）生成更长序列，recency eviction 丢弃的 比例更高，而 high-sparsity phase（answer 阶段）序列短，recency 保留率高。这种 \\\"序列长度 × eviction 比例\\\" 的交互在低 sparsity (s015) 时可忽略（pruning 不够aggressive），但在 s025 时 compound effect 足够大，使得 recency 也表现出统计显著的 phase gradient。 关键区别在于 magnitude：importance d_z≈0.95 vs recency d_z≈0.47，差异约 2×， 说明 scoring mechanism 仍有放大作用，但不再是 \\\"有无\\\" 的 qualitative dissociation， 而是 magnitude 的 quantitative 差异。这直接 undermines \\\"phase gradient is scoring-specific\\\" 的 claim。\\n\"\n65\t  },\n66\t  {\n67\t    \"name\": \"recency_s030\",\n68\t    \"description\": \"Recency-based eviction at s=0.30 (n=100, DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B). Worst 预测: 更强的 phase gradient，进一步确认 universality。\",\n69\t    \"results\": {\n70\t      \"n_problems\": 100,\n71\t      \"model\": \"DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B\",\n72\t      \"masking_method\": \"recency\",\n73\t      \"sparsity\": 0.3,\n74\t      \"phase_gradient_median_diff\": 0.687,\n75\t      \"phase_gradient_median_diff_ci\": [\n76\t        0.328,\n77\t        1.142\n78\t      ],\n79\t      \"cohens_dz\": 0.58,\n80\t      \"wilcoxon_p\": 0.00031,\n81\t      \"bonferroni_p_k3\": 0.00093,\n82\t      \"significant_bonferroni\": true,\n83\t      \"low_phase_ii_median\": 3.412,\n84\t      \"high_phase_ii_median\": 2.725,\n85\t      \"low_high_ratio\": 1.25,\n86\t      \"comparison_importance_s030_dz\": 1.126,\n87\t      \"comparison_random_s030_median_diff\": 1.538,\n88\t      \"comparison_random_s030_dz\": 0.52,\n89\t      \"triple_dissociation_holds\": false,\n90\t      \"importance_recency_ratio\": 1.94,\n91\t      \"recency_random_ratio\": 1.12\n92\t    },\n93\t    \"tables\": [\n94\t      {\n95\t        \"title\": \"Dose-Response of Phase Gradient (d_z) by Strategy and Sparsity\",\n96\t        \"columns\": [\n97\t          \"Strategy\",\n98\t          \"s015_dz\",\n99\t          \"s025_dz\",\n100\t          \"s030_dz\",\n101\t          \"Monotonic?\"\n102\t        ],\n103\t        \"rows\": [\n104\t          [\n105\t            \"Importance\",\n106\t            \"0.574\",\n107\t            \"0.953\",\n108\t            \"1.126\",\n109\t            \"Yes\"\n110\t          ],\n111\t          [\n112\t            \"Recency\",\n113\t            \"0.083 (NS)\",\n114\t            \"0.470*\",\n115\t            \"0.580*\",\n116\t            \"Yes (onset at s025)\"\n117\t          ],\n118\t          [\n119\t            \"Random\",\n120\t            \"-0.045 (NS)\",\n121\t            \"0.410*\",\n122\t            \"0.520*\",\n123\t            \"Yes (onset at s025)\"\n124\t          ]\n125\t        ]\n126\t      }\n127\t    ],\n128\t    \"figures\": [],\n129\t    \"analysis\": \"recency s030 完全确认 phase gradient 的 universality。三种策略形成清晰的 magnitude hierarchy (importance >> recency ≈ random)，但 qualitative dissociation 不成立。 Scoring mechanism 的作用从 \\\"necessary condition for gradient existence\\\" 降级为 \\\"amplification factor ~2×\\\"。这对论文 framing 的影响： (1) C11 必须从 \\\"partially_confirmed\\\" 改为 \\\"refuted_at_high_sparsity\\\"； (2) 论文 abstract/intro 不能再 claim \\\"scoring-independent eviction produces null gradient\\\" without qualifier \\\"at low sparsity only\\\"； (3) discrimination collapse 从 \\\"explains why gradient exists\\\" 变为 \\\"explains why gradient is ~2× larger for score-based methods\\\"。\\n\\n\\ns030 进一步加剧 s025 的模式。Head pruning 率 30% 下（移除 ~235 heads），任何 token removal 策略在 low-sparsity phase 上都会产生 disproportionate damage，因为： (1) low-sparsity phase 的 token 数更多（thinking 阶段占总 token ~45%），被 evict 的绝对数量大； (2) compound effect 在已 pruned 的残余 heads 上被放大——fewer remaining heads 意味着 每个被错误 evict 的 token 影响力更大； (3) recency eviction 在 long sequences 上系统性丢弃 early context（thinking 阶段前期的 推理步骤），这些 early tokens 恰好 contribute most to dense-model perplexity gradient。 d_z 从 s025 的 0.47 上升到 0.58，与 importance（s025→s030: 0.95→1.13）和 random （s025→s030: 0.41→0.52）的 dose-response 趋势一致。 三种策略的 d_z 排序: importance(1.13) > recency(0.58) > random(0.52)， 但 recency 和 random 之间差异很小（0.06），远小于 importance 和两者的差距（~0.55-0.61）。 这形成 \\\"importance >> {recency ≈ random}\\\" 的模式而非 \\\"importance >> recency = 0, random = 0\\\"。\\n\"\n130\t  },\n131\t  {\n132\t    \"name\": \"gpqa_ds_importance_s020\",\n133\t    \"description\": \"GPQA Diamond (n≈198) DeepSeek importance masking at s=0.20. Worst 预测: phase gradient 存在但弱于 s015，dose-response 非单调。\",\n134\t    \"results\": {\n135\t      \"n_problems\": 198,\n136\t      \"model\": \"DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B\",\n137\t      \"masking_method\": \"importance\",\n138\t      \"sparsity\": 0.2,\n139\t      \"interaction_index\": {\n140\t        \"high\": {\n141\t          \"mean\": 0.085,\n142\t          \"median\": 0.008,\n143\t          \"ci\": [\n144\t            0.021,\n145\t            0.198\n146\t          ],\n147\t          \"median_ci\": [\n148\t            0.006,\n149\t            0.011\n150\t          ]\n151\t        },\n152\t        \"mid\": {\n153\t          \"mean\": 0.412,\n154\t          \"median\": 0.067,\n155\t          \"ci\": [\n156\t            0.285,\n157\t            0.572\n158\t          ],\n159\t          \"median_ci\": [\n160\t            0.052,\n161\t            0.084\n162\t          ]\n163\t        },\n164\t        \"low\": {\n165\t          \"mean\": 2.134,\n166\t          \"median\": 0.385,\n167\t          \"ci\": [\n168\t            1.642,\n169\t            2.758\n170\t          ],\n171\t          \"median_ci\": [\n172\t            0.312,\n173\t            0.467\n174\t          ]\n175\t        }\n176\t      },\n177\t      \"perplexity\": {\n178\t        \"high\": {\n179\t          \"dense\": 1.178,\n180\t          \"attn\": 1.58,\n181\t          \"kv\": 1.95,\n182\t          \"both\": 2.85\n183\t        },\n184\t        \"mid\": {\n185\t          \"dense\": 1.308,\n186\t          \"attn\": 1.74,\n187\t          \"kv\": 4.82,\n188\t          \"both\": 7.43\n189\t        },\n190\t        \"low\": {\n191\t          \"dense\": 1.422,\n192\t          \"attn\": 2.05,\n193\t          \"kv\": 28.4,\n194\t          \"both\": 42.1\n195\t        }\n196\t      },\n197\t      \"median_diff\": 0.377,\n198\t      \"median_ratio_low_high\": 48.1,\n199\t      \"wilcoxon_p\": 0.00018,\n200\t      \"cohens_dz\": 0.42,\n201\t      \"pass_fail\": \"PASS\",\n202\t      \"dose_response_vs_s015\": \"LOWER ratio (48.1 vs 75.2) — NON-MONOTONIC\"\n203\t    },\n204\t    \"tables\": [\n205\t      {\n206\t        \"title\": \"GPQA Dose-Response: Median Ratio (low/high) across Sparsity\",\n207\t        \"columns\": [\n208\t          \"Sparsity\",\n209\t          \"low_median\",\n210\t          \"high_median\",\n211\t          \"Ratio\",\n212\t          \"vs MATH-500 ratio\"\n213\t        ],\n214\t        \"rows\": [\n215\t          [\n216\t            \"s015\",\n217\t            \"0.960\",\n218\t            \"0.013\",\n219\t            \"75.2×\",\n220\t            \"66× (MATH-500 s015)\"\n221\t          ],\n222\t          [\n223\t            \"s020\",\n224\t            \"0.385\",\n225\t            \"0.008\",\n226\t            \"48.1×\",\n227\t            \"103× (MATH-500 s020)\"\n228\t          ]\n229\t        ]\n230\t      }\n231\t    ],\n232\t    \"figures\": [],\n233\t    \"analysis\": \"GPQA s020 的 non-monotonic drop 是 worst tier 的核心问题。MATH-500 上 ratio 从 s015→s020 增加 ~1.6×，但 GPQA 反而下降 36%（75.2→48.1）。这意味着 \\\"dose-response monotonicity\\\" 作为 generalization 的 evidence 仅限于 MATH-500 和 GSM8K（同类 math reasoning）， 在 science QA 上不成立。Reviewer 会指出 \\\"the dose-response property that anchors your sub-exponential claim (C6) does not transfer to GPQA, suggesting the monotonicity is task-specific rather than a fundamental property of compound sparsity.\\\" Reframe: 承认 dose-response monotonicity 是 math-reasoning-specific，在 GPQA 上 phase gradient EXISTS 但 magnitude scaling 不同。仍保留 \\\"phase gradient is universal\\\" 但放弃 \\\"gradient scaling is universal\\\"。\\n\\n\\nGPQA 问题平均推理链 ~6000 tokens（远长于 MATH-500 的 ~1200 tokens）。在 s=0.20 时， KV cache eviction 对长序列的影响出现非线性：(1) GPQA 的 low-sparsity phase 包含大量 scientific reasoning 和 domain-specific retrieval，这些 token 的 importance distribution 本身就更 uniform（科学推理中 attention 更分散），使得 \\\"importance vs random\\\" 的区分度在 baseline 就较弱；(2) s020 的 head pruning 恰好移除了某些 \\\"specialist heads\\\"（处理 domain-specific patterns 的 attention heads），导致残余 heads 被迫 redistribute attention 更 uniformly，paradoxically REDUCING importance gradient 在 both phases 上的差异； (3) 结果是 s020 的 low/high ratio (48.1×) LOWER than s015 (75.2×)——dose-response 非单调。这不是说 compound effect 变小了（absolute II values 增大），而是 phase gradient 的 RELATIVE 放大率下降了，因为 high phase 的 II 增长比例大于 low phase。\\n\"\n234\t  },\n235\t  {\n236\t    \"name\": \"gpqa_ds_importance_s025\",\n237\t    \"description\": \"GPQA Diamond (n≈198) DeepSeek importance masking at s=0.25. Worst 预测: gradient 回升但 CI 宽，整体 pattern 不如 MATH-500 clean。\",\n238\t    \"results\": {\n239\t      \"n_problems\": 198,\n240\t      \"model\": \"DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B\",\n241\t      \"masking_method\": \"importance\",\n242\t      \"sparsity\": 0.25,\n243\t      \"interaction_index\": {\n244\t        \"high\": {\n245\t          \"mean\": 0.524,\n246\t          \"median\": 0.031,\n247\t          \"ci\": [\n248\t            0.178,\n249\t            1.052\n250\t          ],\n251\t          \"median_ci\": [\n252\t            0.023,\n253\t            0.042\n254\t          ]\n255\t        },\n256\t        \"mid\": {\n257\t          \"mean\": 3.872,\n258\t          \"median\": 0.418,\n259\t          \"ci\": [\n260\t            2.341,\n261\t            5.892\n262\t          ],\n263\t          \"median_ci\": [\n264\t            0.312,\n265\t            0.548\n266\t          ]\n267\t        },\n268\t        \"low\": {\n269\t          \"mean\": 8.412,\n270\t          \"median\": 1.672,\n271\t          \"ci\": [\n272\t            5.873,\n273\t            11.934\n274\t          ],\n275\t          \"median_ci\": [\n276\t            1.312,\n277\t            2.148\n278\t          ]\n279\t        }\n280\t      },\n281\t      \"perplexity\": {\n282\t        \"high\": {\n283\t          \"dense\": 1.178,\n284\t          \"attn\": 1.72,\n285\t          \"kv\": 2.41,\n286\t          \"both\": 4.52\n287\t        },\n288\t        \"mid\": {\n289\t          \"dense\": 1.308,\n290\t          \"attn\": 1.92,\n291\t          \"kv\": 8.73,\n292\t          \"both\": 18.4\n293\t        },\n294\t        \"low\": {\n295\t          \"dense\": 1.422,\n296\t          \"attn\": 2.23,\n297\t          \"kv\": 45.2,\n298\t          \"both\": 78.3\n299\t        }\n300\t      },\n301\t      \"median_diff\": 1.641,\n302\t      \"median_ratio_low_high\": 53.9,\n303\t      \"wilcoxon_p\": 2.1e-08,\n304\t      \"cohens_dz\": 0.61,\n305\t      \"pass_fail\": \"PASS\",\n306\t      \"dose_response_vs_s020\": \"Increases from s020 (48.1→53.9) but still below s015 (75.2)\",\n307\t      \"overall_dose_response\": \"NON-MONOTONIC: s015(75.2) > s025(53.9) > s020(48.1)\"\n308\t    },\n309\t    \"tables\": [\n310\t      {\n311\t        \"title\": \"GPQA vs MATH-500 Dose-Response Comparison\",\n312\t        \"columns\": [\n313\t          \"Benchmark\",\n314\t          \"s015 ratio\",\n315\t          \"s020 ratio\",\n316\t          \"s025 ratio\",\n317\t          \"Monotonic?\"\n318\t        ],\n319\t        \"rows\": [\n320\t          [\n321\t            \"MATH-500\",\n322\t            \"66×\",\n323\t            \"103×\",\n324\t            \"222×\",\n325\t            \"Yes ✓\"\n326\t          ],\n327\t          [\n328\t            \"GSM8K (DS)\",\n329\t            \"—\",\n330\t            \"—\",\n331\t            \"~8×\",\n332\t            \"Yes ✓ (but weak)\"\n333\t          ],\n334\t          [\n335\t            \"GPQA (DS)\",\n336\t            \"75.2×\",\n337\t            \"48.1×\",\n338\t            \"53.9×\",\n339\t            \"NO ✗\"\n340\t          ]\n341\t        ]\n342\t      }\n343\t    ],\n344\t    \"figures\": [],\n345\t    \"analysis\": \"GPQA 的 non-monotonic dose-response 是 worst tier 中 cross-benchmark generalization  weakening 的直接证据。Reviewer 会正确指出三点： (1) \\\"Monotonic dose-response on MATH-500/GSM8K may be an artifact of math-reasoning structure (shorter chains, more structured output) rather than a fundamental property\\\"； (2) \\\"GPQA ratio actually starts HIGH at s015 (75.2×) then drops — opposite of MATH-500 pattern — suggesting different tasks have different sensitivity profiles\\\"； (3) \\\"The inconsistency across benchmarks weakens the 'universal quantification' contribution claim.\\\" Reframe strategy: 承认 dose-response scaling 是 task-modulated，但 phase gradient EXISTENCE (low > high) 在所有条件下成立（所有 PASS）。论文 contribution 从 \\\"discovery + quantification of monotonic scaling\\\" 调整为 \\\"discovery of universal phase gradient + task-dependent magnitude modulation\\\"。\\n\\n\\n在 s025 时 compound effect 足够强，low phase 的 absolute degradation 大幅增加 (median 0.385→1.672, ~4.3×)，而 high phase 也增加但比例较小 (0.008→0.031, ~3.9×)。 Ratio 从 s020 的 48.1 回升到 53.9，但仍低于 s015 的 75.2，形成非单调 V-shape 的后半段。 这个 pattern 的 mechanistic 解释：GPQA 问题在 s025 时模型开始 \\\"放弃\\\" 某些 domain retrieval（low phase 的长推理链中出现更多 repetitive/degenerate tokens），这些 degenerate tokens 在 importance eviction 下被 disproportionately 保留（因为 repetition 产生 high self-attention），导致 low phase 的 II 被 artificially inflated。 High phase 因为是 answer 阶段（短且结构化），不受此 artifact 影响。 整体 GPQA dose-response: [75.2, 48.1, 53.9] — 非单调，与 MATH-500 的 [66, 103, 222, 276] 形成鲜明对比。\\n\"\n346\t  },\n347\t  {\n348\t    \"name\": \"gpqa_ds_importance_s030\",\n349\t    \"description\": \"GPQA Diamond (n≈198) DeepSeek importance masking at s=0.30. Worst 预测: gradient 存在但被 model collapse 压缩，ratio 继续非单调。\",\n350\t    \"results\": {\n351\t      \"n_problems\": 198,\n352\t      \"model\": \"DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B\",\n353\t      \"masking_method\": \"importance\",\n354\t      \"sparsity\": 0.3,\n355\t      \"interaction_index\": {\n356\t        \"high\": {\n357\t          \"mean\": 1.872,\n358\t          \"median\": 0.098,\n359\t          \"ci\": [\n360\t            0.823,\n361\t            3.412\n362\t          ],\n363\t          \"median_ci\": [\n364\t            0.071,\n365\t            0.132\n366\t          ]\n367\t        },\n368\t        \"mid\": {\n369\t          \"mean\": 12.34,\n370\t          \"median\": 1.842,\n371\t          \"ci\": [\n372\t            7.82,\n373\t            18.92\n374\t          ],\n375\t          \"median_ci\": [\n376\t            1.312,\n377\t            2.534\n378\t          ]\n379\t        },\n380\t        \"low\": {\n381\t          \"mean\": 18.72,\n382\t          \"median\": 3.214,\n383\t          \"ci\": [\n384\t            12.41,\n385\t            27.83\n386\t          ],\n387\t          \"median_ci\": [\n388\t            2.412,\n389\t            4.312\n390\t          ]\n391\t        }\n392\t      },\n393\t      \"perplexity\": {\n394\t        \"high\": {\n395\t          \"dense\": 1.178,\n396\t          \"attn\": 1.84,\n397\t          \"kv\": 3.12,\n398\t          \"both\": 7.82\n399\t        },\n400\t        \"mid\": {\n401\t          \"dense\": 1.308,\n402\t          \"attn\": 2.14,\n403\t          \"kv\": 15.3,\n404\t          \"both\": 45.2\n405\t        },\n406\t        \"low\": {\n407\t          \"dense\": 1.422,\n408\t          \"attn\": 2.52,\n409\t          \"kv\": 72.4,\n410\t          \"both\": 148.3\n411\t        }\n412\t      },\n413\t      \"median_diff\": 3.116,\n414\t      \"median_ratio_low_high\": 32.8,\n415\t      \"wilcoxon_p\": 8.3e-12,\n416\t      \"cohens_dz\": 0.72,\n417\t      \"pass_fail\": \"PASS\",\n418\t      \"dose_response_full\": \"[75.2, 48.1, 53.9, 32.8] — overall DECLINING trend\"\n419\t    },\n420\t    \"tables\": [\n421\t      {\n422\t        \"title\": \"GPQA Full Dose-Response (DS importance)\",\n423\t        \"columns\": [\n424\t          \"Sparsity\",\n425\t          \"low_median\",\n426\t          \"high_median\",\n427\t          \"Ratio\",\n428\t          \"d_z\",\n429\t          \"p\"\n430\t        ],\n431\t        \"rows\": [\n432\t          [\n433\t            \"s015\",\n434\t            \"0.960\",\n435\t            \"0.013\",\n436\t            \"75.2×\",\n437\t            \"0.68\",\n438\t            \"<1e-10\"\n439\t          ],\n440\t          [\n441\t            \"s020\",\n442\t            \"0.385\",\n443\t            \"0.008\",\n444\t            \"48.1×\",\n445\t            \"0.42\",\n446\t            \"0.00018\"\n447\t          ],\n448\t          [\n449\t            \"s025\",\n450\t            \"1.672\",\n451\t            \"0.031\",\n452\t            \"53.9×\",\n453\t            \"0.61\",\n454\t            \"2.1e-8\"\n455\t          ],\n456\t          [\n457\t            \"s030\",\n458\t            \"3.214\",\n459\t            \"0.098\",\n460\t            \"32.8×\",\n461\t            \"0.72\",\n462\t            \"8.3e-12\"\n463\t          ]\n464\t        ]\n465\t      }\n466\t    ],\n467\t    \"figures\": [],\n468\t    \"analysis\": \"GPQA 完整 dose-response 揭示一个 nuanced pattern：absolute gradient (median_diff) 单调递增 (0.95→0.38→1.64→3.12... 等等 s020 是 0.38 比 s015 的 0.95 小？这也非单调)， 实际上 absolute 也非单调。这使得 GPQA 结果对 reviewer 来说是 \\\"messy\\\"： 既不是 clean monotonic（如 MATH-500），也不是 complete null（否则可以说 task-specific）。 Reviewer 会 flag：\\\"inconsistent dose-response across benchmarks undermines the claim of systematic quantification — you've found a phenomenon that behaves differently in every setting tested.\\\" Paper 最大的 vulnerability 在于 GPQA 结果与 MATH-500/GSM8K 不一致， 且不一致的 pattern 没有 mechanistic explanation（只有 post-hoc speculation about sequence length effects）。\\n\\n\\n在 s030 时 GPQA 出现 \\\"compression ceiling\\\" 效应：low phase 的 perplexity 已经极高 (both=148.3)，模型在这个 phase 实际上已经产生 near-random output，进一步增加 sparsity 的 marginal damage 递减（从 \\\"bad reasoning\\\" 到 \\\"gibberish\\\" 的差距小于 \\\"good reasoning\\\" 到 \\\"bad reasoning\\\"）。而 high phase (answer 阶段) 虽然也恶化，但因为本身短且模型有更多 \\\"模板化\\\" 的 answer patterns，degradation 更 gradual。结果是 low/high ratio 从 53.9 下降到 32.8——low phase 的 II 增长放缓而 high phase 的 II 仍在 catch up。 这形成 GPQA 特有的 \\\"inverted U\\\" 可能性：ratio 在 s015 最高，随后下降。 与 MATH-500 的 monotonic escalation 完全相反。 核心原因：GPQA 推理链更长，在 extreme sparsity 下先于 MATH-500 触及 \\\"total collapse\\\"， phase gradient 被 ceiling effect 压缩。\\n\"\n469\t  },\n470\t  {\n471\t    \"name\": \"gpqa_ds_random_s015\",\n472\t    \"description\": \"GPQA Diamond (n≈198) DeepSeek random masking at s=0.15. 用于计算 GPQA 上的 strategy specificity ratio。Worst 预测: ratio 很低 (1.2-2.5×)。\",\n473\t    \"results\": {\n474\t      \"n_problems\": 198,\n475\t      \"model\": \"DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B\",\n476\t      \"masking_method\": \"random\",\n477\t      \"sparsity\": 0.15,\n478\t      \"interaction_index\": {\n479\t        \"high\": {\n480\t          \"mean\": 0.142,\n481\t          \"median\": 0.009,\n482\t          \"ci\": [\n483\t            0.032,\n484\t            0.312\n485\t          ],\n486\t          \"median_ci\": [\n487\t            0.006,\n488\t            0.013\n489\t          ]\n490\t        },\n491\t        \"mid\": {\n492\t          \"mean\": 0.523,\n493\t          \"median\": 0.068,\n494\t          \"ci\": [\n495\t            0.312,\n496\t            0.782\n497\t          ],\n498\t          \"median_ci\": [\n499\t            0.048,\n500\t            0.092\n501\t          ]\n502\t        },\n503\t        \"low\": {\n504\t          \"mean\": 3.412,\n505\t          \"median\": 0.512,\n506\t          \"ci\": [\n507\t            2.123,\n508\t            5.012\n509\t          ],\n510\t          \"median_ci\": [\n511\t            0.398,\n512\t            0.652\n513\t          ]\n514\t        }\n515\t      },\n516\t      \"median_diff\": 0.503,\n517\t      \"median_ratio_low_high\": 56.9,\n518\t      \"wilcoxon_p\": 0.0012,\n519\t      \"cohens_dz\": 0.38,\n520\t      \"pass_fail\": \"PASS_unexpected\",\n521\t      \"strategy_specificity_ratio\": 1.88,\n522\t      \"comparison_vs_math500\": \"MATH-500 imp/rand ratio ≈ 15-17×; GPQA only 1.88×\"\n523\t    },\n524\t    \"tables\": [\n525\t      {\n526\t        \"title\": \"Strategy Specificity Ratio Across Benchmarks\",\n527\t        \"columns\": [\n528\t          \"Benchmark\",\n529\t          \"Avg Chain Length\",\n530\t          \"Imp/Rand Ratio (s015)\",\n531\t          \"Imp/Rand Ratio (s025)\"\n532\t        ],\n533\t        \"rows\": [\n534\t          [\n535\t            \"MATH-500\",\n536\t            \"~1200 tok\",\n537\t            \"~28×\",\n538\t            \"15.5×\"\n539\t          ],\n540\t          [\n541\t            \"GSM8K\",\n542\t            \"~400 tok\",\n543\t            \"2.3×\",\n544\t            \"3.8×\"\n545\t          ],\n546\t          [\n547\t            \"GPQA\",\n548\t            \"~6000 tok\",\n549\t            \"1.88×\",\n550\t            \"~1.5× (predicted)\"\n551\t          ]\n552\t        ]\n553\t      }\n554\t    ],\n555\t    \"figures\": [],\n556\t    \"analysis\": \"GPQA strategy specificity ratio ~1.9× 是 worst tier 的关键数据点。 Reviewer 会 argue：\\\"if the importance/random distinction is only 1.9× on GPQA (vs 15-17× on MATH-500), then the 'scoring-specific' nature of the phenomenon is benchmark-dependent, not a fundamental property. The large ratio on MATH-500 might be an artifact of short reasoning chains where random eviction happens to be benign.\\\" 这与 recency control 的 breakdown 形成 converging evidence： scoring specificity 在多个维度（high sparsity, long sequences, different tasks）都弱化。 Paper 必须 honest about this limitation：strategy specificity 是 context-dependent, strongest for short math reasoning, weakest for long scientific reasoning。\\n\\n\\nGPQA 上 random masking 也产生显著 phase gradient 的原因： (1) GPQA 的 reasoning 序列极长（平均 ~6000 tokens），random eviction 在长序列上 的 damage 与 sequence position 高度相关——later tokens（more in low phase）依赖 earlier tokens（already evicted），形成 cascading information loss； (2) GPQA 的 scientific reasoning 需要维持长程 coherence（引用前文定义、保持论证链）， random eviction 在长序列上 inevitably 打断这些依赖，且 low phase 有更多这类依赖； (3) 结果是 random 在 GPQA 上产生 phase gradient (d_z=0.38)，而在 MATH-500 s015 上 是 NS (d_z≈-0.05)。Strategy specificity ratio 仅 1.88×（importance 0.95/random 0.50）， 远低于 MATH-500 的 15-17×。 这与 GSM8K 的 pattern 一致（GSM8K strategy specificity 也衰减至 2.3-3.8×）， 表明 strategy specificity 是 task-dependent，且与 reasoning chain length 负相关。\\n\"\n557\t  },\n558\t  {\n559\t    \"name\": \"reviewer_simulation\",\n560\t    \"description\": \"模拟 EMNLP 2026 reviewer 基于 worst tier 数据的评审结果。\",\n561\t    \"results\": {\n562\t      \"reviewer_avg_score\": 2.75,\n563\t      \"reviewer_novelty_score\": 2.4,\n564\t      \"reviewer_soundness_score\": 3.2,\n565\t      \"reviewer_significance_score\": 2.5,\n566\t      \"reviewer_clarity_score\": 3.5,\n567\t      \"accept_probability\": 0.15,\n568\t      \"key_criticisms\": [\n569\t        \"Phase gradient is universal across eviction strategies at high sparsity, undermining the scoring-specific framing\",\n570\t        \"GPQA dose-response is non-monotonic, suggesting the quantification framework is task-specific\",\n571\t        \"Relationship to Physics of KV Cache Compression (2603.01426) is insufficiently distinguished — both study phase-dependent compression behavior\",\n572\t        \"Strategy specificity ratio varies 1.9×-17× across conditions — too fragile to be a reliable finding\",\n573\t        \"Empirical contribution is real but incremental: adds one more dimension (phase) to known compound sparsity analysis\"\n574\t      ],\n575\t      \"novelty_concern\": \"\\\"The core finding — that compound sparsity hurts more in some reasoning phases than others — is intuitive once stated. Physics of KV Cache Compression already showed phase transitions in single-axis compression. ThinKV already exploits phase-dependent behavior. The contribution of systematically quantifying the three-way interaction is valid but the non-monotonic GPQA results and breakdown of scoring specificity at high sparsity make the quantification feel incomplete and context-specific rather than systematic.\\\"\\n\",\n576\t      \"suggested_reframe\": \"\\\"Position as exploratory empirical study of compound sparsity behavior across contexts, explicitly acknowledging that the patterns are task-dependent and architecture-dependent. Reduce claims from 'universal phenomenon' to 'observed pattern with known boundary conditions'. EMNLP Findings track more appropriate than main conference.\\\"\\n\"\n577\t    },\n578\t    \"tables\": [\n579\t      {\n580\t        \"title\": \"Predicted Reviewer Scores (3 reviewers)\",\n581\t        \"columns\": [\n582\t          \"Criterion\",\n583\t          \"R1\",\n584\t          \"R2\",\n585\t          \"R3\",\n586\t          \"Mean\"\n587\t        ],\n588\t        \"rows\": [\n589\t          [\n590\t            \"Overall\",\n591\t            \"3.0\",\n592\t            \"2.5\",\n593\t            \"2.75\",\n594\t            \"2.75\"\n595\t          ],\n596\t          [\n597\t            \"Novelty\",\n598\t            \"2.5\",\n599\t            \"2.0\",\n600\t            \"2.75\",\n601\t            \"2.42\"\n602\t          ],\n603\t          [\n604\t            \"Soundness\",\n605\t            \"3.5\",\n606\t            \"3.0\",\n607\t            \"3.0\",\n608\t            \"3.17\"\n609\t          ],\n610\t          [\n611\t            \"Significance\",\n612\t            \"2.5\",\n613\t            \"2.5\",\n614\t            \"2.5\",\n615\t            \"2.50\"\n616\t          ]\n617\t        ]\n618\t      }\n619\t    ],\n620\t    \"figures\": [],\n621\t    \"analysis\": \"在 worst tier 下，论文仍有 path to acceptance（Findings track），条件是： (1) Honest framing: \\\"empirical characterization of compound sparsity behavior\\\" 而非 \\\"discovery of universal mechanism\\\"； (2) 承认所有 boundary conditions up front（task-dependence, architecture-dependence, sparsity-threshold-dependence of scoring specificity）； (3) Position 三维交互量化为 \\\"first comprehensive measurement\\\"（即使 pattern 是 messy）； (4) Explicitly contrast with Physics of KV Cache 在 Introduction 中，而非 Related Work 中 被 reviewer 发现。 投稿 strategy: 如果数据确实是 worst tier，考虑 target Findings 而非 main， 或延期 submission 补充更多 benchmarks 建立 clear pattern。\\n\\nReviewer score 2.75 (borderline reject) 因为： (1) Novelty: Physics of KV Cache Compression 2603.01426 是 2026年3月的工作， 直接研究 KV compression 的 phase-dependent behavior，reviewer 会认为 overlapping contribution； (2) Robustness: GPQA 非单调 + strategy specificity task-dependent + recency gradient at high sparsity = \\\"the finding is fragile and boundary conditions are unclear\\\"； (3) Mechanism: discrimination collapse 只 partially confirmed (Qwen entropy 不一致)， 且不再能解释 recency/random 为何也有 gradient（它们没有 importance score）； (4) 但 soundness 仍然 decent (3.2) 因为统计方法 rigorous，cross-model/cross-arch validation 扎实。 最可能的结果：borderline reject → Findings track。\\n\"\n622\t  }\n623\t]"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3c29118d-6acc-4b61-a26a-390979a0b42e","uuid":"d6b687e4-58f2-4b4f-a099-b46bc27e7528","timestamp":"2026-05-17T01:15:39.195Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_11/projects/phase-gated-compound-sparse/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260517T005655/worst/experiment_data.json","content":"[\n  {\n    \"name\": \"recency_s025\",\n    \"description\": \"Recency-based eviction at s=0.25 (n=100, DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B). 原假设: recency 在高 sparsity 仍无 phase gradient，维持 triple dissociation。Worst 预测: recency 产生显著 phase gradient。\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"n_problems\": 100,\n      \"model\": \"DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B\",\n      \"masking_method\": \"recency\",\n      \"sparsity\": 0.25,\n      \"phase_gradient_median_diff\": 0.312,\n      \"phase_gradient_median_diff_ci\": [\n        0.145,\n        0.508\n      ],\n      \"cohens_dz\": 0.47,\n      \"wilcoxon_p\": 0.0023,\n      \"bonferroni_p_k3\": 0.0069,\n      \"significant_bonferroni\": true,\n      \"low_phase_ii_median\": 1.284,\n      \"high_phase_ii_median\": 0.972,\n      \"low_high_ratio\": 1.32,\n      \"comparison_importance_s025_dz\": 0.953,\n      \"comparison_random_s025_median_diff\": 0.257,\n      \"comparison_random_s025_dz\": 0.41,\n      \"triple_dissociation_holds\": false,\n      \"importance_recency_ratio\": 2.03\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Phase Gradient Comparison: Three Strategies at s=0.25\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Strategy\",\n          \"median_diff\",\n          \"d_z\",\n          \"p (Bonf)\",\n          \"Interpretation\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Importance\",\n            \"3.986\",\n            \"0.953\",\n            \"<1e-15\",\n            \"Large\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Recency\",\n            \"0.312\",\n            \"0.470\",\n            \"0.0069\",\n            \"Medium (SIGNIFICANT)\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Random\",\n            \"0.257\",\n            \"0.410\",\n            \"0.012\",\n            \"Medium (SIGNIFICANT)\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"recency s025 结果 devastating for scoring-specificity claim。s015 的 triple dissociation (importance 有 gradient，recency+random 均 NS) 被证明是 low-sparsity 的 floor effect 而非 mechanistic dissociation。在更 aggressive 的 compound sparsity 下，所有 eviction strategies 都产生 phase gradient，只是 magnitude 不同。Reviewer 会正确指出： \\\"if all strategies show gradient at sufficient sparsity, the phenomenon is a generic property of token removal under compound stress, not scoring-specific.\\\" 必须放弃 C11 的 \\\"scoring-independent control confirms specificity\\\" framing， 转为 \\\"gradient universality with strategy-modulated magnitude\\\"。\\n\\n\\n在 s=0.25 时，head pruning 已移除 ~196 heads（28×7×0.25），残余 KV cache 中 token 位置信息的分布被严重扭曲。 Recency eviction 虽不直接使用 attention score，但其 \\\"保留最近 token\\\" 的策略在高 pruning 率下产生 非平凡的 phase 依赖：low-sparsity phase（对应 thinking 阶段）生成更长序列，recency eviction 丢弃的 比例更高，而 high-sparsity phase（answer 阶段）序列短，recency 保留率高。这种 \\\"序列长度 × eviction 比例\\\" 的交互在低 sparsity (s015) 时可忽略（pruning 不够aggressive），但在 s025 时 compound effect 足够大，使得 recency 也表现出统计显著的 phase gradient。 关键区别在于 magnitude：importance d_z≈0.95 vs recency d_z≈0.47，差异约 2×， 说明 scoring mechanism 仍有放大作用，但不再是 \\\"有无\\\" 的 qualitative dissociation， 而是 magnitude 的 quantitative 差异。这直接 undermines \\\"phase gradient is scoring-specific\\\" 的 claim。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"recency_s030\",\n    \"description\": \"Recency-based eviction at s=0.30 (n=100, DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B). Worst 预测: 更强的 phase gradient，进一步确认 universality。\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"n_problems\": 100,\n      \"model\": \"DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B\",\n      \"masking_method\": \"recency\",\n      \"sparsity\": 0.3,\n      \"phase_gradient_median_diff\": 0.687,\n      \"phase_gradient_median_diff_ci\": [\n        0.328,\n        1.142\n      ],\n      \"cohens_dz\": 0.58,\n      \"wilcoxon_p\": 0.00031,\n      \"bonferroni_p_k3\": 0.00093,\n      \"significant_bonferroni\": true,\n      \"low_phase_ii_median\": 3.412,\n      \"high_phase_ii_median\": 2.725,\n      \"low_high_ratio\": 1.25,\n      \"comparison_importance_s030_dz\": 1.126,\n      \"comparison_random_s030_median_diff\": 1.538,\n      \"comparison_random_s030_dz\": 0.52,\n      \"triple_dissociation_holds\": false,\n      \"importance_recency_ratio\": 1.94,\n      \"recency_random_ratio\": 1.12\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Dose-Response of Phase Gradient (d_z) by Strategy and Sparsity\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Strategy\",\n          \"s015_dz\",\n          \"s025_dz\",\n          \"s030_dz\",\n          \"Monotonic?\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Importance\",\n            \"0.574\",\n            \"0.953\",\n            \"1.126\",\n            \"Yes\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Recency\",\n            \"0.083 (NS)\",\n            \"0.470*\",\n            \"0.580*\",\n            \"Yes (onset at s025)\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Random\",\n            \"-0.045 (NS)\",\n            \"0.410*\",\n            \"0.520*\",\n            \"Yes (onset at s025)\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"recency s030 完全确认 phase gradient 的 universality。三种策略形成清晰的 magnitude hierarchy (importance >> recency ≈ random)，但 qualitative dissociation 不成立。 Scoring mechanism 的作用从 \\\"necessary condition for gradient existence\\\" 降级为 \\\"amplification factor ~2×\\\"。这对论文 framing 的影响： (1) C11 必须从 \\\"partially_confirmed\\\" 改为 \\\"refuted_at_high_sparsity\\\"； (2) 论文 abstract/intro 不能再 claim \\\"scoring-independent eviction produces null gradient\\\" without qualifier \\\"at low sparsity only\\\"； (3) discrimination collapse 从 \\\"explains why gradient exists\\\" 变为 \\\"explains why gradient is ~2× larger for score-based methods\\\"。\\n\\n\\ns030 进一步加剧 s025 的模式。Head pruning 率 30% 下（移除 ~235 heads），任何 token removal 策略在 low-sparsity phase 上都会产生 disproportionate damage，因为： (1) low-sparsity phase 的 token 数更多（thinking 阶段占总 token ~45%），被 evict 的绝对数量大； (2) compound effect 在已 pruned 的残余 heads 上被放大——fewer remaining heads 意味着 每个被错误 evict 的 token 影响力更大； (3) recency eviction 在 long sequences 上系统性丢弃 early context（thinking 阶段前期的 推理步骤），这些 early tokens 恰好 contribute most to dense-model perplexity gradient。 d_z 从 s025 的 0.47 上升到 0.58，与 importance（s025→s030: 0.95→1.13）和 random （s025→s030: 0.41→0.52）的 dose-response 趋势一致。 三种策略的 d_z 排序: importance(1.13) > recency(0.58) > random(0.52)， 但 recency 和 random 之间差异很小（0.06），远小于 importance 和两者的差距（~0.55-0.61）。 这形成 \\\"importance >> {recency ≈ random}\\\" 的模式而非 \\\"importance >> recency = 0, random = 0\\\"。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"gpqa_ds_importance_s020\",\n    \"description\": \"GPQA Diamond (n≈198) DeepSeek importance masking at s=0.20. Worst 预测: phase gradient 存在但弱于 s015，dose-response 非单调。\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"n_problems\": 198,\n      \"model\": \"DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B\",\n      \"masking_method\": \"importance\",\n      \"sparsity\": 0.2,\n      \"interaction_index\": {\n        \"high\": {\n          \"mean\": 0.085,\n          \"median\": 0.008,\n          \"ci\": [\n            0.021,\n            0.198\n          ],\n          \"median_ci\": [\n            0.006,\n            0.011\n          ]\n        },\n        \"mid\": {\n          \"mean\": 0.412,\n          \"median\": 0.067,\n          \"ci\": [\n            0.285,\n            0.572\n          ],\n          \"median_ci\": [\n            0.052,\n            0.084\n          ]\n        },\n        \"low\": {\n          \"mean\": 2.134,\n          \"median\": 0.385,\n          \"ci\": [\n            1.642,\n            2.758\n          ],\n          \"median_ci\": [\n            0.312,\n            0.467\n          ]\n        }\n      },\n      \"perplexity\": {\n        \"high\": {\n          \"dense\": 1.178,\n          \"attn\": 1.58,\n          \"kv\": 1.95,\n          \"both\": 2.85\n        },\n        \"mid\": {\n          \"dense\": 1.308,\n          \"attn\": 1.74,\n          \"kv\": 4.82,\n          \"both\": 7.43\n        },\n        \"low\": {\n          \"dense\": 1.422,\n          \"attn\": 2.05,\n          \"kv\": 28.4,\n          \"both\": 42.1\n        }\n      },\n      \"median_diff\": 0.377,\n      \"median_ratio_low_high\": 48.1,\n      \"wilcoxon_p\": 0.00018,\n      \"cohens_dz\": 0.42,\n      \"pass_fail\": \"PASS\",\n      \"dose_response_vs_s015\": \"LOWER ratio (48.1 vs 75.2) — NON-MONOTONIC\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"GPQA Dose-Response: Median Ratio (low/high) across Sparsity\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Sparsity\",\n          \"low_median\",\n          \"high_median\",\n          \"Ratio\",\n          \"vs MATH-500 ratio\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"s015\",\n            \"0.960\",\n            \"0.013\",\n            \"75.2×\",\n            \"66× (MATH-500 s015)\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"s020\",\n            \"0.385\",\n            \"0.008\",\n            \"48.1×\",\n            \"103× (MATH-500 s020)\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"GPQA s020 的 non-monotonic drop 是 worst tier 的核心问题。MATH-500 上 ratio 从 s015→s020 增加 ~1.6×，但 GPQA 反而下降 36%（75.2→48.1）。这意味着 \\\"dose-response monotonicity\\\" 作为 generalization 的 evidence 仅限于 MATH-500 和 GSM8K（同类 math reasoning）， 在 science QA 上不成立。Reviewer 会指出 \\\"the dose-response property that anchors your sub-exponential claim (C6) does not transfer to GPQA, suggesting the monotonicity is task-specific rather than a fundamental property of compound sparsity.\\\" Reframe: 承认 dose-response monotonicity 是 math-reasoning-specific，在 GPQA 上 phase gradient EXISTS 但 magnitude scaling 不同。仍保留 \\\"phase gradient is universal\\\" 但放弃 \\\"gradient scaling is universal\\\"。\\n\\n\\nGPQA 问题平均推理链 ~6000 tokens（远长于 MATH-500 的 ~1200 tokens）。在 s=0.20 时， KV cache eviction 对长序列的影响出现非线性：(1) GPQA 的 low-sparsity phase 包含大量 scientific reasoning 和 domain-specific retrieval，这些 token 的 importance distribution 本身就更 uniform（科学推理中 attention 更分散），使得 \\\"importance vs random\\\" 的区分度在 baseline 就较弱；(2) s020 的 head pruning 恰好移除了某些 \\\"specialist heads\\\"（处理 domain-specific patterns 的 attention heads），导致残余 heads 被迫 redistribute attention 更 uniformly，paradoxically REDUCING importance gradient 在 both phases 上的差异； (3) 结果是 s020 的 low/high ratio (48.1×) LOWER than s015 (75.2×)——dose-response 非单调。这不是说 compound effect 变小了（absolute II values 增大），而是 phase gradient 的 RELATIVE 放大率下降了，因为 high phase 的 II 增长比例大于 low phase。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"gpqa_ds_importance_s025\",\n    \"description\": \"GPQA Diamond (n≈198) DeepSeek importance masking at s=0.25. Worst 预测: gradient 回升但 CI 宽，整体 pattern 不如 MATH-500 clean。\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"n_problems\": 198,\n      \"model\": \"DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B\",\n      \"masking_method\": \"importance\",\n      \"sparsity\": 0.25,\n      \"interaction_index\": {\n        \"high\": {\n          \"mean\": 0.524,\n          \"median\": 0.031,\n          \"ci\": [\n            0.178,\n            1.052\n          ],\n          \"median_ci\": [\n            0.023,\n            0.042\n          ]\n        },\n        \"mid\": {\n          \"mean\": 3.872,\n          \"median\": 0.418,\n          \"ci\": [\n            2.341,\n            5.892\n          ],\n          \"median_ci\": [\n            0.312,\n            0.548\n          ]\n        },\n        \"low\": {\n          \"mean\": 8.412,\n          \"median\": 1.672,\n          \"ci\": [\n            5.873,\n            11.934\n          ],\n          \"median_ci\": [\n            1.312,\n            2.148\n          ]\n        }\n      },\n      \"perplexity\": {\n        \"high\": {\n          \"dense\": 1.178,\n          \"attn\": 1.72,\n          \"kv\": 2.41,\n          \"both\": 4.52\n        },\n        \"mid\": {\n          \"dense\": 1.308,\n          \"attn\": 1.92,\n          \"kv\": 8.73,\n          \"both\": 18.4\n        },\n        \"low\": {\n          \"dense\": 1.422,\n          \"attn\": 2.23,\n          \"kv\": 45.2,\n          \"both\": 78.3\n        }\n      },\n      \"median_diff\": 1.641,\n      \"median_ratio_low_high\": 53.9,\n      \"wilcoxon_p\": 2.1e-08,\n      \"cohens_dz\": 0.61,\n      \"pass_fail\": \"PASS\",\n      \"dose_response_vs_s020\": \"Increases from s020 (48.1→53.9) but still below s015 (75.2)\",\n      \"overall_dose_response\": \"NON-MONOTONIC: s015(75.2) > s025(53.9) > s020(48.1)\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"GPQA vs MATH-500 Dose-Response Comparison\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Benchmark\",\n          \"s015 ratio\",\n          \"s020 ratio\",\n          \"s025 ratio\",\n          \"Monotonic?\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"MATH-500\",\n            \"66×\",\n            \"103×\",\n            \"222×\",\n            \"Yes ✓\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"GSM8K (DS)\",\n            \"—\",\n            \"—\",\n            \"~8×\",\n            \"Yes ✓ (but weak)\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"GPQA (DS)\",\n            \"75.2×\",\n            \"48.1×\",\n            \"53.9×\",\n            \"NO ✗\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"GPQA 的 non-monotonic dose-response 是 worst tier 中 cross-benchmark generalization  weakening 的直接证据。Reviewer 会正确指出三点： (1) \\\"Monotonic dose-response on MATH-500/GSM8K may be an artifact of math-reasoning structure (shorter chains, more structured output) rather than a fundamental property\\\"； (2) \\\"GPQA ratio actually starts HIGH at s015 (75.2×) then drops — opposite of MATH-500 pattern — suggesting different tasks have different sensitivity profiles\\\"； (3) \\\"The inconsistency across benchmarks weakens the 'universal quantification' contribution claim.\\\" Reframe strategy: 承认 dose-response scaling 是 task-modulated，但 phase gradient EXISTENCE (low > high) 在所有条件下成立（所有 PASS）。论文 contribution 从 \\\"discovery + quantification of monotonic scaling\\\" 调整为 \\\"discovery of universal phase gradient + task-dependent magnitude modulation\\\"。\\n\\n\\n在 s025 时 compound effect 足够强，low phase 的 absolute degradation 大幅增加 (median 0.385→1.672, ~4.3×)，而 high phase 也增加但比例较小 (0.008→0.031, ~3.9×)。 Ratio 从 s020 的 48.1 回升到 53.9，但仍低于 s015 的 75.2，形成非单调 V-shape 的后半段。 这个 pattern 的 mechanistic 解释：GPQA 问题在 s025 时模型开始 \\\"放弃\\\" 某些 domain retrieval（low phase 的长推理链中出现更多 repetitive/degenerate tokens），这些 degenerate tokens 在 importance eviction 下被 disproportionately 保留（因为 repetition 产生 high self-attention），导致 low phase 的 II 被 artificially inflated。 High phase 因为是 answer 阶段（短且结构化），不受此 artifact 影响。 整体 GPQA dose-response: [75.2, 48.1, 53.9] — 非单调，与 MATH-500 的 [66, 103, 222, 276] 形成鲜明对比。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"gpqa_ds_importance_s030\",\n    \"description\": \"GPQA Diamond (n≈198) DeepSeek importance masking at s=0.30. Worst 预测: gradient 存在但被 model collapse 压缩，ratio 继续非单调。\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"n_problems\": 198,\n      \"model\": \"DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B\",\n      \"masking_method\": \"importance\",\n      \"sparsity\": 0.3,\n      \"interaction_index\": {\n        \"high\": {\n          \"mean\": 1.872,\n          \"median\": 0.098,\n          \"ci\": [\n            0.823,\n            3.412\n          ],\n          \"median_ci\": [\n            0.071,\n            0.132\n          ]\n        },\n        \"mid\": {\n          \"mean\": 12.34,\n          \"median\": 1.842,\n          \"ci\": [\n            7.82,\n            18.92\n          ],\n          \"median_ci\": [\n            1.312,\n            2.534\n          ]\n        },\n        \"low\": {\n          \"mean\": 18.72,\n          \"median\": 3.214,\n          \"ci\": [\n            12.41,\n            27.83\n          ],\n          \"median_ci\": [\n            2.412,\n            4.312\n          ]\n        }\n      },\n      \"perplexity\": {\n        \"high\": {\n          \"dense\": 1.178,\n          \"attn\": 1.84,\n          \"kv\": 3.12,\n          \"both\": 7.82\n        },\n        \"mid\": {\n          \"dense\": 1.308,\n          \"attn\": 2.14,\n          \"kv\": 15.3,\n          \"both\": 45.2\n        },\n        \"low\": {\n          \"dense\": 1.422,\n          \"attn\": 2.52,\n          \"kv\": 72.4,\n          \"both\": 148.3\n        }\n      },\n      \"median_diff\": 3.116,\n      \"median_ratio_low_high\": 32.8,\n      \"wilcoxon_p\": 8.3e-12,\n      \"cohens_dz\": 0.72,\n      \"pass_fail\": \"PASS\",\n      \"dose_response_full\": \"[75.2, 48.1, 53.9, 32.8] — overall DECLINING trend\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"GPQA Full Dose-Response (DS importance)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Sparsity\",\n          \"low_median\",\n          \"high_median\",\n          \"Ratio\",\n          \"d_z\",\n          \"p\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"s015\",\n            \"0.960\",\n            \"0.013\",\n            \"75.2×\",\n            \"0.68\",\n            \"<1e-10\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"s020\",\n            \"0.385\",\n            \"0.008\",\n            \"48.1×\",\n            \"0.42\",\n            \"0.00018\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"s025\",\n            \"1.672\",\n            \"0.031\",\n            \"53.9×\",\n            \"0.61\",\n            \"2.1e-8\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"s030\",\n            \"3.214\",\n            \"0.098\",\n            \"32.8×\",\n            \"0.72\",\n            \"8.3e-12\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"GPQA 完整 dose-response 揭示一个 nuanced pattern：absolute gradient (median_diff) 单调递增 (0.95→0.38→1.64→3.12... 等等 s020 是 0.38 比 s015 的 0.95 小？这也非单调)， 实际上 absolute 也非单调。这使得 GPQA 结果对 reviewer 来说是 \\\"messy\\\"： 既不是 clean monotonic（如 MATH-500），也不是 complete null（否则可以说 task-specific）。 Reviewer 会 flag：\\\"inconsistent dose-response across benchmarks undermines the claim of systematic quantification — you've found a phenomenon that behaves differently in every setting tested.\\\" Paper 最大的 vulnerability 在于 GPQA 结果与 MATH-500/GSM8K 不一致， 且不一致的 pattern 没有 mechanistic explanation（只有 post-hoc speculation about sequence length effects）。\\n\\n\\n在 s030 时 GPQA 出现 \\\"compression ceiling\\\" 效应：low phase 的 perplexity 已经极高 (both=148.3)，模型在这个 phase 实际上已经产生 near-random output，进一步增加 sparsity 的 marginal damage 递减（从 \\\"bad reasoning\\\" 到 \\\"gibberish\\\" 的差距小于 \\\"good reasoning\\\" 到 \\\"bad reasoning\\\"）。而 high phase (answer 阶段) 虽然也恶化，但因为本身短且模型有更多 \\\"模板化\\\" 的 answer patterns，degradation 更 gradual。结果是 low/high ratio 从 53.9 下降到 32.8——low phase 的 II 增长放缓而 high phase 的 II 仍在 catch up。 这形成 GPQA 特有的 \\\"inverted U\\\" 可能性：ratio 在 s015 最高，随后下降。 与 MATH-500 的 monotonic escalation 完全相反。 核心原因：GPQA 推理链更长，在 extreme sparsity 下先于 MATH-500 触及 \\\"total collapse\\\"， phase gradient 被 ceiling effect 压缩。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"gpqa_ds_random_s015\",\n    \"description\": \"GPQA Diamond (n≈198) DeepSeek random masking at s=0.15. 用于计算 GPQA 上的 strategy specificity ratio。Worst 预测: ratio 很低 (1.2-2.5×)。\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"n_problems\": 198,\n      \"model\": \"DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B\",\n      \"masking_method\": \"random\",\n      \"sparsity\": 0.15,\n      \"interaction_index\": {\n        \"high\": {\n          \"mean\": 0.142,\n          \"median\": 0.009,\n          \"ci\": [\n            0.032,\n            0.312\n          ],\n          \"median_ci\": [\n            0.006,\n            0.013\n          ]\n        },\n        \"mid\": {\n          \"mean\": 0.523,\n          \"median\": 0.068,\n          \"ci\": [\n            0.312,\n            0.782\n          ],\n          \"median_ci\": [\n            0.048,\n            0.092\n          ]\n        },\n        \"low\": {\n          \"mean\": 3.412,\n          \"median\": 0.512,\n          \"ci\": [\n            2.123,\n            5.012\n          ],\n          \"median_ci\": [\n            0.398,\n            0.652\n          ]\n        }\n      },\n      \"median_diff\": 0.503,\n      \"median_ratio_low_high\": 56.9,\n      \"wilcoxon_p\": 0.0012,\n      \"cohens_dz\": 0.38,\n      \"pass_fail\": \"PASS_unexpected\",\n      \"strategy_specificity_ratio\": 1.88,\n      \"comparison_vs_math500\": \"MATH-500 imp/rand ratio ≈ 15-17×; GPQA only 1.88×\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Strategy Specificity Ratio Across Benchmarks\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Benchmark\",\n          \"Avg Chain Length\",\n          \"Imp/Rand Ratio (s015)\",\n          \"Imp/Rand Ratio (s025)\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"MATH-500\",\n            \"~1200 tok\",\n            \"~28×\",\n            \"15.5×\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"GSM8K\",\n            \"~400 tok\",\n            \"2.3×\",\n            \"3.8×\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"GPQA\",\n            \"~6000 tok\",\n            \"1.88×\",\n            \"~1.5× (predicted)\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"GPQA strategy specificity ratio ~1.9× 是 worst tier 的关键数据点。 Reviewer 会 argue：\\\"if the importance/random distinction is only 1.9× on GPQA (vs 15-17× on MATH-500), then the 'scoring-specific' nature of the phenomenon is benchmark-dependent, not a fundamental property. The large ratio on MATH-500 might be an artifact of short reasoning chains where random eviction happens to be benign.\\\" 这与 recency control 的 breakdown 形成 converging evidence： scoring specificity 在多个维度（high sparsity, long sequences, different tasks）都弱化。 Paper 必须 honest about this limitation：strategy specificity 是 context-dependent, strongest for short math reasoning, weakest for long scientific reasoning。\\n\\n\\nGPQA 上 random masking 也产生显著 phase gradient 的原因： (1) GPQA 的 reasoning 序列极长（平均 ~6000 tokens），random eviction 在长序列上 的 damage 与 sequence position 高度相关——later tokens（more in low phase）依赖 earlier tokens（already evicted），形成 cascading information loss； (2) GPQA 的 scientific reasoning 需要维持长程 coherence（引用前文定义、保持论证链）， random eviction 在长序列上 inevitably 打断这些依赖，且 low phase 有更多这类依赖； (3) 结果是 random 在 GPQA 上产生 phase gradient (d_z=0.38)，而在 MATH-500 s015 上 是 NS (d_z≈-0.05)。Strategy specificity ratio 仅 1.88×（importance 0.95/random 0.50）， 远低于 MATH-500 的 15-17×。 这与 GSM8K 的 pattern 一致（GSM8K strategy specificity 也衰减至 2.3-3.8×）， 表明 strategy specificity 是 task-dependent，且与 reasoning chain length 负相关。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"reviewer_simulation\",\n    \"description\": \"模拟 EMNLP 2026 reviewer 基于 worst tier 数据的评审结果。\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"reviewer_avg_score\": 2.75,\n      \"reviewer_novelty_score\": 2.4,\n      \"reviewer_soundness_score\": 3.2,\n      \"reviewer_significance_score\": 2.5,\n      \"reviewer_clarity_score\": 3.5,\n      \"accept_probability\": 0.15,\n      \"key_criticisms\": [\n        \"Phase gradient is universal across eviction strategies at high sparsity, undermining the scoring-specific framing\",\n        \"GPQA dose-response is non-monotonic, suggesting the quantification framework is task-specific\",\n        \"Relationship to Physics of KV Cache Compression (2603.01426) is insufficiently distinguished — both study phase-dependent compression behavior\",\n        \"Strategy specificity ratio varies 1.9×-17× across conditions — too fragile to be a reliable finding\",\n        \"Empirical contribution is real but incremental: adds one more dimension (phase) to known compound sparsity analysis\"\n      ],\n      \"novelty_concern\": \"\\\"The core finding — that compound sparsity hurts more in some reasoning phases than others — is intuitive once stated. Physics of KV Cache Compression already showed phase transitions in single-axis compression. ThinKV already exploits phase-dependent behavior. The contribution of systematically quantifying the three-way interaction is valid but the non-monotonic GPQA results and breakdown of scoring specificity at high sparsity make the quantification feel incomplete and context-specific rather than systematic.\\\"\\n\",\n      \"suggested_reframe\": \"\\\"Position as exploratory empirical study of compound sparsity behavior across contexts, explicitly acknowledging that the patterns are task-dependent and architecture-dependent. Reduce claims from 'universal phenomenon' to 'observed pattern with known boundary conditions'. EMNLP Findings track more appropriate than main conference.\\\"\\n\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Predicted Reviewer Scores (3 reviewers)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Criterion\",\n          \"R1\",\n          \"R2\",\n          \"R3\",\n          \"Mean\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Overall\",\n            \"3.0\",\n            \"2.5\",\n            \"2.75\",\n            \"2.75\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Novelty\",\n            \"2.5\",\n            \"2.0\",\n            \"2.75\",\n            \"2.42\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Soundness\",\n            \"3.5\",\n            \"3.0\",\n            \"3.0\",\n            \"3.17\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Significance\",\n            \"2.5\",\n            \"2.5\",\n            \"2.5\",\n            \"2.50\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"在 worst tier 下，论文仍有 path to acceptance（Findings track），条件是： (1) Honest framing: \\\"empirical characterization of compound sparsity behavior\\\" 而非 \\\"discovery of universal mechanism\\\"； (2) 承认所有 boundary conditions up front（task-dependence, architecture-dependence, sparsity-threshold-dependence of scoring specificity）； (3) Position 三维交互量化为 \\\"first comprehensive measurement\\\"（即使 pattern 是 messy）； (4) Explicitly contrast with Physics of KV Cache 在 Introduction 中，而非 Related Work 中 被 reviewer 发现。 投稿 strategy: 如果数据确实是 worst tier，考虑 target Findings 而非 main， 或延期 submission 补充更多 benchmarks 建立 clear pattern。\\n\\nReviewer score 2.75 (borderline reject) 因为： (1) Novelty: Physics of KV Cache Compression 2603.01426 是 2026年3月的工作， 直接研究 KV compression 的 phase-dependent behavior，reviewer 会认为 overlapping contribution； (2) Robustness: GPQA 非单调 + strategy specificity task-dependent + recency gradient at high sparsity = \\\"the finding is fragile and boundary conditions are unclear\\\"； (3) Mechanism: discrimination collapse 只 partially confirmed (Qwen entropy 不一致)， 且不再能解释 recency/random 为何也有 gradient（它们没有 importance score）； (4) 但 soundness 仍然 decent (3.2) 因为统计方法 rigorous，cross-model/cross-arch validation 扎实。 最可能的结果：borderline reject → Findings track。\\n\"\n  }\n]","numLines":623,"startLine":1,"totalLines":623}}}
