{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_011XnMEju8VxXS6EevELywz2","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Paper Framing — Phase-Gated Compound Sparsity\n2\t\n3\t> 最后更新: 2026-05-16 (新增 C11 recency control claim; RC2 更新; Paper Positioning 扩展 experimental design contribution; c8_llama_n250_fixed n=250; imp/rand 2.7-17×) | 维护者: Director\n4\t\n5\t## Core Insight\n6\t\n7\tCompound sparsity（attention head pruning + KV cache eviction）的 severity 不是固定常数——它是 eviction strategy 和 reasoning phase 交互的涌现属性。Importance-based eviction 的 compound interaction severity（paired median difference: median(II_low_i − II_high_i)）随 sparsity 单调递增（DeepSeek: 0.39→1.21→3.99→8.48; Qwen: 0.07→0.31→1.07→3.16），而 random masking 在 s015/s020 NS，在 s025 跨模型显著但效应量远小于 importance（DS: 0.257 vs 3.986; QW: 0.393 vs 1.074, 2.7-17×差异），存在 sparsity threshold ~s020-s025（D063; s030 待定）。Cohen's d（per-problem paired, B=10000）从 medium 到 large（DeepSeek: 0.61→1.13; Qwen: 0.37→1.44，registry cohens_d s015→s030）。LLaMA 跨架构验证（D060, c8_llama_n250_fixed, n=250）：within-importance phase gradient 强（d_z=0.81-1.15, all p<10^-29, all monotonic），且 random 在 LLaMA 上所有条件均显著（d_z=0.41-0.46, all p<10^-12），imp/rand Δ ratio 仅 2.0-2.6×（vs DeepSeek 15-17×），strategy×phase 交互强度 architecture-dependent。GSM8K 跨 benchmark 验证（D075）：importance masking 的 phase gradient 在 GSM8K 上同样单调递增（QW: 0.039→0.158→1.100→2.092; DS: 0.241→0.740→1.992→4.682），但 strategy specificity（importance/random gradient ratio）从 MATH-500 的 15-17× 衰减至 GSM8K 的 2.3-3.8×。注意：\"反转\"仅在原始 II_low 值上（random > importance），phase gradient 层面 importance ≥ random。Strategy specificity 的 task-dependence 机制是开放问题（见 §6 Discussion）。这一发现挑战了 compound degradation 均匀分布的隐含假设。\n8\t\n9\t**数字基准**：所有数字基于 bf16 per-problem paired 统计量（B=10000 bootstrap）。median_diff 定义为 median(II_low_i − II_high_i)（逐 problem 配对差的中位数）。fp16 旧数据已弃用。\n10\t\n11\t## Narrative Arc\n12\t\n13\tCompound sparsity 是高效 LLM 推理的实用部署需求，但 prior work（SparK, Ada-KV, SLiM）将 compound interaction 视为均匀超可加。我们发现 severity 是 strategy × phase 交互的涌现属性：importance eviction 的 compound interaction 在 low-sparsity phase 远大��� high-sparsity phase（paired median difference 单调递增 0.39→8.48），而 random eviction 在低 sparsity (s015/s020) NS，在 s025+ 跨模型显著但效应量远小于 importance (2.7-17×)——存在 sparsity threshold (~s020-s025)，低于阈值 compound effect importance-specific，高于阈值两者均触发但 importance 主导。Cross-model replication 方向一致（Qwen magnitude ~1/4 of DeepSeek，onset threshold s≥0.20）。LLaMA 跨架构验证已完成（c8_llama_n250_fixed, n=250, D060）：within-importance phase gradient 强（d_z=0.81-1.15, all p<10^-29），random 所有条件���著（d_z=0.41-0.46, all p<10^-12），但 imp/rand ratio 仅 2.0-2.6×（远低于 DS 15-17×）���strategy×phase 交互强度 architecture-dependent。Recency-based eviction（scoring-independent control, D100）在 s015 产生 null phase gradient（d_z=0.083, NS），确认 phase-dependent severity 是 attention-score-based eviction 的特有交互效应而非 token removal 的 trivial 副产物。我们通过 discrimination collapse 机制解释这一现象：head pruning → importance score 的判别力崩塌（Gini/CV 下降跨模型一致）→ importance eviction 退化为有偏伪随机。Attention entropy redistribution 作为 model-dependent secondary effect 在 DeepSeek 上观察到，但在 Qwen 上不稳健（D044）。\n14\t\n15\t**Framing 硬约束（D015）**：\n16\t- MUST: \\\"emergent phase-strategy interaction\\\"\n17\t- MUST NOT: \\\"importance metric limitation / importance is broken\\\"\n18\t- MUST NOT: claim \\\"importance masking produces super-additive interaction\\\" without qualifier — random masking also produces positive II, and at s025+ random is statistically significant (D063). The distinguishing signal is **magnitude gradient** (importance 2.7-17× larger) and **onset threshold** (random NS below ~s020, importance significant from s015+), not the existence of super-additivity itself (D023)\n19\t\n20\t## Core Claims\n21\t\n22\t| ID | Claim | Status | Key Evidence |\n23\t|----|-------|--------|-------------|\n24\t| C1 | Compound sparsity severity is strategy- and task-modulated | confirmed | MATH-500: importance gradient 15-17× random (DeepSeek s025-s030); GSM8K: ratio 衰减至 2.3-3.8× (D075)。Phase gradient 层��� importance ≥ random 跨 benchmark 成立，但 magnitude ratio task-dependent。Threshold ~s020-s025 (D063) |\n25\t| C2 | Severity is phase-modulated (amplified in low-sparsity phase) | confirmed | bf16 paired median difference 单调递增: 0.39→1.21→3.99→8.48; Bonferroni p<0.005 全 4 水平 (D032)。预注册：n=500 后若 QW s015 CI 仍跨零，叙事改为 'compound effect emerges above threshold sparsity (~s020)' |\n26\t| C3 | Phase-strategy crossover exists | confirmed | s=0.25: importance high_phase=0.032 < random=0.818, importance low_phase=7.196 > random=1.363 (bf16) |\n27\t| C4 | Discrimination collapse as primary mechanism; entropy redistribution model-dependent | partially_confirmed | D044: Gini/CV 下降跨模型一致; entropy collapse DeepSeek 一致但 Qwen s025 反转(+0.045) s030≈0。30/30 problems completed. |\n28\t| C5 | Phase-modulated compound severity generalizes across models | confirmed | DeepSeek + Qwen cross-model replication: 方向一致, Cohen's d ρ=1.0, gradient permutation p=0.043. Qwen magnitude ~1/4 of DeepSeek, onset threshold s≥0.20 (S3→C). |\n29\t| C5b | Phase-aware mitigation recovers compound degradation | future_work | D056: pilot 完成 gate_failed。Oracle recovery 18% < 30% gate (Wilcoxon p=0.002)，heuristic 32% 但 CI 跨零。方向正确但效应量不足，需更精细 phase boundary estimation → future work |\n30\t| C6 | Severity gradient is sub-exponential | confirmed | Growth rate decreasing: Δ增长因子 3.8×→4.8×→2.0×（递减） |\n31\t| C7 | Statistical power at n=500 confirms dose-response | confirmed | c2_n500_deepseek (success) + c2_qw_n500_r3 (success): 两模型 n=500 全 4 sparsity Bonferroni p<0.005, Spearman ρ=1.0 |\n32\t| C8 | Cross-architecture validation (LLaMA) | confirmed | c8_llama_n250_fixed (n=250, D060): within-importance phase gradient d_z=0.81-1.15 (all p<10^-29, all monotonic) ✓。Random ��有条件显著 (d_z=0.41-0.46, all p<10^-12)，与 DeepSeek/Qwen random 低 sparsity NS 模式定性不同。Imp/rand Δ ratio 2.0-2.6×（远低于 DS 15-17×）。Strategy specificity architecture-dependent。n=250 功效充分。 |\n33\t| C9 | Differentiation from Lethe/SparK prior work | planned | Related Work §2 引用区分 + SparK gap analysis |\n34\t| C10 | Phase gradient cross-benchmark robust; strategy specificity task-modulated | confirmed | GSM8K DS gradient 0.241→4.682 单调递增; QW gradient 0.039→2.092; imp/rand ratio ��减至 2.3-3.8× (D075)。QW random s025+s030 均 success |\n35\t| C11 | Phase-dependent severity absent under scoring-independent eviction (recency control) | partially_confirmed | recency_s015 (n=100, D100): median_diff=-0.003, d_z=0.083 (negligible), p=0.77 (NS). Low/high ratio=2.28, CI=[-0.11, 6.67] 包含 1。对比 importance s015: d_z=0.574, ratio=119.8×, 差异 ~152×。Triple dissociation: importance 有 gradient, recency + random 均 NS。排除 (a) phase segmentation circularity (b) H2O scoring pathway confound。待 s025/s030 确认后升为 confirmed。 |\n36\t| S3→C | Onset threshold is model-dependent (DeepSeek s≥0.15, Qwen s≥0.20) | confirmed | D037/D038: Qwen s015 d_z=0.37 CI含0, s020+ 显著 |\n37\t| S7→C | Dose-response monotonicity (Spearman ρ=1.0) | confirmed | D047: 6-point dose-response, 单调递增 |\n38\t\n39\t## Anticipated Reviewer Concerns\n40\t\n41\t### RC1: Generalizability — 7B models only, benchmark scope\n42\t- **预期质疑**: \\\"Results on two 7B models and MATH-500 only. How do we know this generalizes to larger models or other reasoning tasks?\\\"\n43\t- **应对**: 四层泛化证据：(1) Cross-model: DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B + Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct（同架构不同训练，ρ=1.0）(2) Cross-architecture: c8_llama_n250_fixed (DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Llama-8B, LlamaForCausalLM, n=250)，within-importance phase gradient 强 (d_z=0.81-1.15)，但 strategy specificity 弱于 Qwen2 架构（2.0-2.6× vs 15-17×），strategy×phase 交互强度 architecture-dependent (3) **Cross-benchmark (D075)**: GSM8K（两模型）phase gradient 单调递增复现（DS: 0.241→4.682; QW: 0.039→2.092），但 strategy specificity ratio 从 MATH-500 15-17× 衰减至 2.3-3.8×，表明 phase modulation 跨 benchmark 稳健而 magnitude modulation task-dependent。Limitations 诚实声明：(a) 7B scale only；(b) strategy specificity 强度 task-dependent（GSM8K 衰减，可能因��理链更短）；(c) random phase gradient 行为 architecture-dependent。\n44\t- **实验支撑**: C5 (cross-model) + C8 (c8_llama_n250_fixed cross-architecture, n=250) + C10 (cross-benchmark GSM8K, D075)\n45\t\n46\t### RC2: Methodology — phase segmentation circularity and scoring confound\n47\t- **预期质疑**: \\\"Your phase segmentation uses perplexity computed from the same model whose sparsity you're measuring. Isn't this circular? And H2O's attention-score mechanism could itself create the phase gradient artifact.\\\"\n48\t- **应对**: Recency-based eviction (scoring-independent control) produces null phase gradient (d_z=0.083, p=0.77, NS at s015), confirming the observed severity pattern is specific to attention-score-based methods, not an artifact of (a) phase segmentation itself or (b) the scoring computation pathway. Triple dissociation: importance shows gradient (d_z=0.574), recency and random both NS. Novel experimental design: repurposing recency eviction as methodological control has no precedent in literature (H2O/StreamingLLM use it only as performance baseline). 待 s025/s030 全面确认。\n49\t- **实验支撑**: C11 (recency_s015, recency_s025/s030 running) + c4_entropy (discrimination collapse mechanism, D044)\n50\t\n51\t### RC3: Practical impact — 没有 throughput 数据\n52\t- **��期质疑**: \\\"No wall-clock or throughput measurements. Is the severity amplification reflected in actual inference speed?\\\"\n53\t- **应对**: 本文定位是 empirical finding paper（发现 + 机制解释），不是 method paper。Throughput 不是 claim 的一部分。Discussion 中明确 phase-gated controller 作为 future direction。\n54\t  - C5b pilot 已完成（D056）：oracle recovery 18%（Wilcoxon p=0.002），heuristic recovery 32%（p=0.024），但两者 95% CI 均跨零。方向正确（Wilcoxon 显著）但效应量不足（未达 30% gate），需更精细的 phase boundary estimation。论文 §6 Discussion 诚实报告 pilot 结果 + future work。\n55\t  - Heuristic > oracle 悖论值得提及：token position ratio 粗粒度划分可能恰好更适合 mitigation 场景，暗示 phase boundary 的最优粒度是开放问题。\n56\t- **实验支撑**: c5b_pilot (gate_failed, D056)\n57\t\n58\t### RC4: Statistical rigor — bootstrap 是否足够\n59\t- **预期质疑**: \\\"Per-problem bootstrap with 50 problems — sufficient sample size?\\\"\n60\t- **应对**: bf16 使用 B=10000 per-problem paired bootstrap，有效配对数 n=49 (DeepSeek) / n=46 (Qwen)；n=500 实验进一步验证 (C7 confirmed)。Permutation test 使用 paired median difference 作为 robust statistic（D032），Bonferroni 校正后全 4 水平 p<0.005。Dose-response 主用 Wilcoxon signed-rank p + median_diff（robust to outliers），Cohen's d 作为辅助效应量（DeepSeek 0.61→1.13, Qwen 0.37→1.44, registry cohens_d s015→s030），注释高 sparsity 下 d 受 outlier-driven variance 影响（DS s020→s025: median 3.3× jump 但 d 非单调，因极端 II 值影响分母，D064）。可在 appendix 补充 per-problem 分布图（已生成 fig4_per_problem_dist.pdf）。\n61\t- **实验支撑**: bf16 permutation test (D032) + Cohen's d per-problem paired (rebootstrap B=10000) + n=500 Wilcoxon (C7 confirmed)\n62\t\n63\t### RC5: Novelty — prior work 是否已覆盖 phase-dependent sparsity\n64\t- **��期质疑**: \"ThinKV and phase-aware methods already consider phase. What's new?\"\n65\t- **应对**: Prior work 在单轴上分析 phase（ThinKV: phase-aware eviction）或 compound（SparK: joint compression）。没有工作同时分析 compound × phase × strategy 的三维交互。Crossover 现象（同一 strategy 在不同 phase 方向反转）��全新发现。Related Work 加 Lethe 引用区分 + SparK 对比。具体��分：\n66\t  - **ThinKV** (arxiv 2510.01290, Oct 2025): 在 KV cache 单轴上做 phase-aware 压缩（�� CoT 阶段差异化 eviction），但不涉及 pruning × eviction 的 compound interaction。我们研究的是双轴（head pruning × KV eviction）compound interaction 如何随 phase 变化，ThinKV 的单轴 phase-aware 策略是我们分析维度的子集。\n67\t  - **Physics of KV Cache Compression** (arxiv 2603.01426, Mar 2026): 揭示了单轴 KV 压缩的 phase transition 和 representational rigidity，是机制层面最接近的工作。关键区分：他们刻画的是单一压缩轴上压缩率的 critical threshold（phase transition），我们刻画的是两种压缩方法的 compound interaction severity 如何被 reasoning phase 调制（phase-dependent gradient）——维度正交。\n68\t  - **HIES** (arxiv 2510.13832, Oct 2025): 发现 importance score collapse 并提出 entropy 补偿，为我们的 discrimination collapse 机制提供独立 supporting evidence——他们在单轴上观察到的 score collapse 正是我们在 compound setting 中发现的 Gini/CV 下降的单轴对应。\n69\t  - **R-KV** (arxiv 2505.24133, May 2025): 针对 reasoning task 做 KV compression 优化，属于 task-specific method。我们不是提出新方法，而是 mechanistic 分析 compound interaction 的 phase-dependent 行为，二者目标不同（optimization vs understanding）。\n70\t- **实验支撑**: C3 (crossover), Related Work §2 的 gap 分析\n71\t\n72\t### RC6: Novelty vs Lethe/SparK\n73\t- **预期质疑**: \"How does this differ from Lethe (AAAI 2026) which also does layer-time-adaptive KV pruning, or SparK which studies compound compression?\"\n74\t- **应对**: Lethe 和 SparK 都没有分析 phase × strategy 的交互效应。Lethe 是 method paper（提出 adaptive eviction 方法），我们是 empirical finding paper（发现 phase-dependent severity gradient）。SparK 研究 compound compression 但将 interaction 视为均匀超可加，我们发现 interaction severity 随 phase 和 strategy 变化。新近工作进一步确认我们的独特定位：\n75\t  - **Physics of KV Cache Compression** (arxiv 2603.01426, Mar 2026) 是最近的相关工作，研究单轴压缩�� phase transition 阈值行为。与我们的核心区别：他们的 phase transition 是压缩率维度上的 critical point，我们的 phase-dependent gradient 是 reasoning phase 维度上 compound interaction 的连续调制——两者刻画的 \"phase\" 语义不同（compression-rate phase vs reasoning phase）。\n76\t  - **ThinKV** (arxiv 2510.01290, Oct 2025) 和 **R-KV** (arxiv 2505.24133, May 2025) 都在 KV compression 单轴上引入 phase/reasoning awareness，但均未涉及 compound interaction。我们的贡献在于揭示 pruning × eviction 双轴交互如何被 reasoning phase 调制，这是单轴方法无法观察到的涌现现象。\n77\t  - **HIES** (arxiv 2510.13832, Oct 2025) 的 importance score collapse 发现为我们的 discrimination collapse 机制提供了独立佐证，但 HIES 聚焦于单轴补偿方法，未研究 collapse 在 compound setting 中的放大效应。\n78\t  - Related Work §2 明确区分三者定位：Lethe/SparK = method/compound method, ThinKV/R-KV = single-axis phase-aware, Physics of KV = single-axis phase transition, HIES = single-axis collapse。我们 = compound × phase × strategy 三维交互分析。\n79\t- **实验支撑**: 不需要额外实验，仅需 §2 引用区分\n80\t\n81\t## Paper Positioning\n82\t\n83\t**类型**: Empirical finding paper（非 method paper）\n84\t**核心贡献**:\n85\t1. 发现 compound sparsity severity 的 strategy × phase 交互\n86\t2. 量化 severity gradient（bf16 paired median difference 0.39→8.48, Cohen's d 0.61→1.13）和 crossover 现象\n87\t3. 提出 discrimination collapse 机制解释（Gini/CV 跨模型一致；entropy redistribution model-dependent）\n88\t4. Cross-model + cross-architecture (LLaMA, n=250) replication 验证泛化性（三模型两架构；strategy×phase 交互强度 architecture-dependent, D060）\n89\t5. Novel use of scoring-independent eviction (recency-based) as methodological control — experimental design contribution 排除 phase segmentation circularity 和 scoring pathway confound (C11)\n90\t\n91\t**投稿目标**: EMNLP 2026 ARR, deadline 2026-05-25\n92\t**Rebuttal 准备**: Day 9 (2026-05-23) 预留 rebuttal letter 写作时间\n93\t**关���时间线**：\n94\t- Day 9 (2026-05-23): 预留写 rebuttal letter\n95\t- Day 11 (2026-05-25): EMNLP 2026 ARR 截稿\n96\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3c29118d-6acc-4b61-a26a-390979a0b42e","uuid":"83353cf7-ea16-4e71-8e8d-2a942a159842","timestamp":"2026-05-17T01:15:39.548Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_11/projects/phase-gated-compound-sparse/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260517T005655/worst/paper_framing.md","content":"# Paper Framing — Phase-Gated Compound Sparsity\n\n> 最后更新: 2026-05-16 (新增 C11 recency control claim; RC2 更新; Paper Positioning 扩展 experimental design contribution; c8_llama_n250_fixed n=250; imp/rand 2.7-17×) | 维护者: Director\n\n## Core Insight\n\nCompound sparsity（attention head pruning + KV cache eviction）的 severity 不是固定常数——它是 eviction strategy 和 reasoning phase 交互的涌现属性。Importance-based eviction 的 compound interaction severity（paired median difference: median(II_low_i − II_high_i)）随 sparsity 单调递增（DeepSeek: 0.39→1.21→3.99→8.48; Qwen: 0.07→0.31→1.07→3.16），而 random masking 在 s015/s020 NS，在 s025 跨模型显著但效应量远小于 importance（DS: 0.257 vs 3.986; QW: 0.393 vs 1.074, 2.7-17×差异），存在 sparsity threshold ~s020-s025（D063; s030 待定）。Cohen's d（per-problem paired, B=10000）从 medium 到 large（DeepSeek: 0.61→1.13; Qwen: 0.37→1.44，registry cohens_d s015→s030）。LLaMA 跨架构验证（D060, c8_llama_n250_fixed, n=250）：within-importance phase gradient 强（d_z=0.81-1.15, all p<10^-29, all monotonic），且 random 在 LLaMA 上所有条件均显著（d_z=0.41-0.46, all p<10^-12），imp/rand Δ ratio 仅 2.0-2.6×（vs DeepSeek 15-17×），strategy×phase 交互强度 architecture-dependent。GSM8K 跨 benchmark 验证（D075）：importance masking 的 phase gradient 在 GSM8K 上同样单调递增（QW: 0.039→0.158→1.100→2.092; DS: 0.241→0.740→1.992→4.682），但 strategy specificity（importance/random gradient ratio）从 MATH-500 的 15-17× 衰减至 GSM8K 的 2.3-3.8×。注意：\"反转\"仅在原始 II_low 值上（random > importance），phase gradient 层面 importance ≥ random。Strategy specificity 的 task-dependence 机制是开放问题（见 §6 Discussion）。这一发现挑战了 compound degradation 均匀分布的隐含假设。\n\n**数字基准**：所有数字基于 bf16 per-problem paired 统计量（B=10000 bootstrap）。median_diff 定义为 median(II_low_i − II_high_i)（逐 problem 配对差的中位数）。fp16 旧数据已弃用。\n\n## Narrative Arc\n\nCompound sparsity 是高效 LLM 推理的实用部署需求，但 prior work（SparK, Ada-KV, SLiM）将 compound interaction 视为均匀超可加。我们发现 severity 是 strategy × phase 交互的涌现属性：importance eviction 的 compound interaction 在 low-sparsity phase 远大��� high-sparsity phase（paired median difference 单调递增 0.39→8.48），而 random eviction 在低 sparsity (s015/s020) NS，在 s025+ 跨模型显著但效应量远小于 importance (2.7-17×)——存在 sparsity threshold (~s020-s025)，低于阈值 compound effect importance-specific，高于阈值两者均触发但 importance 主导。Cross-model replication 方向一致（Qwen magnitude ~1/4 of DeepSeek，onset threshold s≥0.20）。LLaMA 跨架构验证已完成（c8_llama_n250_fixed, n=250, D060）：within-importance phase gradient 强（d_z=0.81-1.15, all p<10^-29），random 所有条件���著（d_z=0.41-0.46, all p<10^-12），但 imp/rand ratio 仅 2.0-2.6×（远低于 DS 15-17×）���strategy×phase 交互强度 architecture-dependent。Recency-based eviction（scoring-independent control, D100）在 s015 产生 null phase gradient（d_z=0.083, NS），确认 phase-dependent severity 是 attention-score-based eviction 的特有交互效应而非 token removal 的 trivial 副产物。我们通过 discrimination collapse 机制解释这一现象：head pruning → importance score 的判别力崩塌（Gini/CV 下降跨模型一致）→ importance eviction 退化为有偏伪随机。Attention entropy redistribution 作为 model-dependent secondary effect 在 DeepSeek 上观察到，但在 Qwen 上不稳健（D044）。\n\n**Framing 硬约束（D015）**：\n- MUST: \\\"emergent phase-strategy interaction\\\"\n- MUST NOT: \\\"importance metric limitation / importance is broken\\\"\n- MUST NOT: claim \\\"importance masking produces super-additive interaction\\\" without qualifier — random masking also produces positive II, and at s025+ random is statistically significant (D063). The distinguishing signal is **magnitude gradient** (importance 2.7-17× larger) and **onset threshold** (random NS below ~s020, importance significant from s015+), not the existence of super-additivity itself (D023)\n\n## Core Claims\n\n| ID | Claim | Status | Key Evidence |\n|----|-------|--------|-------------|\n| C1 | Compound sparsity severity is strategy- and task-modulated | confirmed | MATH-500: importance gradient 15-17× random (DeepSeek s025-s030); GSM8K: ratio 衰减至 2.3-3.8× (D075)。Phase gradient 层��� importance ≥ random 跨 benchmark 成立，但 magnitude ratio task-dependent。Threshold ~s020-s025 (D063) |\n| C2 | Severity is phase-modulated (amplified in low-sparsity phase) | confirmed | bf16 paired median difference 单调递增: 0.39→1.21→3.99→8.48; Bonferroni p<0.005 全 4 水平 (D032)。预注册：n=500 后若 QW s015 CI 仍跨零，叙事改为 'compound effect emerges above threshold sparsity (~s020)' |\n| C3 | Phase-strategy crossover exists | confirmed | s=0.25: importance high_phase=0.032 < random=0.818, importance low_phase=7.196 > random=1.363 (bf16) |\n| C4 | Discrimination collapse as primary mechanism; entropy redistribution model-dependent | partially_confirmed | D044: Gini/CV 下降跨模型一致; entropy collapse DeepSeek 一致但 Qwen s025 反转(+0.045) s030≈0。30/30 problems completed. |\n| C5 | Phase-modulated compound severity generalizes across models | confirmed | DeepSeek + Qwen cross-model replication: 方向一致, Cohen's d ρ=1.0, gradient permutation p=0.043. Qwen magnitude ~1/4 of DeepSeek, onset threshold s≥0.20 (S3→C). |\n| C5b | Phase-aware mitigation recovers compound degradation | future_work | D056: pilot 完成 gate_failed。Oracle recovery 18% < 30% gate (Wilcoxon p=0.002)，heuristic 32% 但 CI 跨零。方向正确但效应量不足，需更精细 phase boundary estimation → future work |\n| C6 | Severity gradient is sub-exponential | confirmed | Growth rate decreasing: Δ增长因子 3.8×→4.8×→2.0×（递减） |\n| C7 | Statistical power at n=500 confirms dose-response | confirmed | c2_n500_deepseek (success) + c2_qw_n500_r3 (success): 两模型 n=500 全 4 sparsity Bonferroni p<0.005, Spearman ρ=1.0 |\n| C8 | Cross-architecture validation (LLaMA) | confirmed | c8_llama_n250_fixed (n=250, D060): within-importance phase gradient d_z=0.81-1.15 (all p<10^-29, all monotonic) ✓。Random ��有条件显著 (d_z=0.41-0.46, all p<10^-12)，与 DeepSeek/Qwen random 低 sparsity NS 模式定性不同。Imp/rand Δ ratio 2.0-2.6×（远低于 DS 15-17×）。Strategy specificity architecture-dependent。n=250 功效充分。 |\n| C9 | Differentiation from Lethe/SparK prior work | planned | Related Work §2 引用区分 + SparK gap analysis |\n| C10 | Phase gradient cross-benchmark robust; strategy specificity task-modulated | confirmed | GSM8K DS gradient 0.241→4.682 单调递增; QW gradient 0.039→2.092; imp/rand ratio ��减至 2.3-3.8× (D075)。QW random s025+s030 均 success |\n| C11 | Phase-dependent severity absent under scoring-independent eviction (recency control) | partially_confirmed | recency_s015 (n=100, D100): median_diff=-0.003, d_z=0.083 (negligible), p=0.77 (NS). Low/high ratio=2.28, CI=[-0.11, 6.67] 包含 1。对比 importance s015: d_z=0.574, ratio=119.8×, 差异 ~152×。Triple dissociation: importance 有 gradient, recency + random 均 NS。排除 (a) phase segmentation circularity (b) H2O scoring pathway confound。待 s025/s030 确认后升为 confirmed。 |\n| S3→C | Onset threshold is model-dependent (DeepSeek s≥0.15, Qwen s≥0.20) | confirmed | D037/D038: Qwen s015 d_z=0.37 CI含0, s020+ 显著 |\n| S7→C | Dose-response monotonicity (Spearman ρ=1.0) | confirmed | D047: 6-point dose-response, 单调递增 |\n\n## Anticipated Reviewer Concerns\n\n### RC1: Generalizability — 7B models only, benchmark scope\n- **预期质疑**: \\\"Results on two 7B models and MATH-500 only. How do we know this generalizes to larger models or other reasoning tasks?\\\"\n- **应对**: 四层泛化证据：(1) Cross-model: DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B + Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct（同架构不同训练，ρ=1.0）(2) Cross-architecture: c8_llama_n250_fixed (DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Llama-8B, LlamaForCausalLM, n=250)，within-importance phase gradient 强 (d_z=0.81-1.15)，但 strategy specificity 弱于 Qwen2 架构（2.0-2.6× vs 15-17×），strategy×phase 交互强度 architecture-dependent (3) **Cross-benchmark (D075)**: GSM8K（两模型）phase gradient 单调递增复现（DS: 0.241→4.682; QW: 0.039→2.092），但 strategy specificity ratio 从 MATH-500 15-17× 衰减至 2.3-3.8×，表明 phase modulation 跨 benchmark 稳健而 magnitude modulation task-dependent。Limitations 诚实声明：(a) 7B scale only；(b) strategy specificity 强度 task-dependent（GSM8K 衰减，可能因��理链更短）；(c) random phase gradient 行为 architecture-dependent。\n- **实验支撑**: C5 (cross-model) + C8 (c8_llama_n250_fixed cross-architecture, n=250) + C10 (cross-benchmark GSM8K, D075)\n\n### RC2: Methodology — phase segmentation circularity and scoring confound\n- **预期质疑**: \\\"Your phase segmentation uses perplexity computed from the same model whose sparsity you're measuring. Isn't this circular? And H2O's attention-score mechanism could itself create the phase gradient artifact.\\\"\n- **应对**: Recency-based eviction (scoring-independent control) produces null phase gradient (d_z=0.083, p=0.77, NS at s015), confirming the observed severity pattern is specific to attention-score-based methods, not an artifact of (a) phase segmentation itself or (b) the scoring computation pathway. Triple dissociation: importance shows gradient (d_z=0.574), recency and random both NS. Novel experimental design: repurposing recency eviction as methodological control has no precedent in literature (H2O/StreamingLLM use it only as performance baseline). 待 s025/s030 全面确认。\n- **实验支撑**: C11 (recency_s015, recency_s025/s030 running) + c4_entropy (discrimination collapse mechanism, D044)\n\n### RC3: Practical impact — 没有 throughput 数据\n- **��期质疑**: \\\"No wall-clock or throughput measurements. Is the severity amplification reflected in actual inference speed?\\\"\n- **应对**: 本文定位是 empirical finding paper（发现 + 机制解释），不是 method paper。Throughput 不是 claim 的一部分。Discussion 中明确 phase-gated controller 作为 future direction。\n  - C5b pilot 已完成（D056）：oracle recovery 18%（Wilcoxon p=0.002），heuristic recovery 32%（p=0.024），但两者 95% CI 均跨零。方向正确（Wilcoxon 显著）但效应量不足（未达 30% gate），需更精细的 phase boundary estimation。论文 §6 Discussion 诚实报告 pilot 结果 + future work。\n  - Heuristic > oracle 悖论值得提及：token position ratio 粗粒度划分可能恰好更适合 mitigation 场景，暗示 phase boundary 的最优粒度是开放问题。\n- **实验支撑**: c5b_pilot (gate_failed, D056)\n\n### RC4: Statistical rigor — bootstrap 是否足够\n- **预期质疑**: \\\"Per-problem bootstrap with 50 problems — sufficient sample size?\\\"\n- **应对**: bf16 使用 B=10000 per-problem paired bootstrap，有效配对数 n=49 (DeepSeek) / n=46 (Qwen)；n=500 实验进一步验证 (C7 confirmed)。Permutation test 使用 paired median difference 作为 robust statistic（D032），Bonferroni 校正后全 4 水平 p<0.005。Dose-response 主用 Wilcoxon signed-rank p + median_diff（robust to outliers），Cohen's d 作为辅助效应量（DeepSeek 0.61→1.13, Qwen 0.37→1.44, registry cohens_d s015→s030），注释高 sparsity 下 d 受 outlier-driven variance 影响（DS s020→s025: median 3.3× jump 但 d 非单调，因极端 II 值影响分母，D064）。可在 appendix 补充 per-problem 分布图（已生成 fig4_per_problem_dist.pdf）。\n- **实验支撑**: bf16 permutation test (D032) + Cohen's d per-problem paired (rebootstrap B=10000) + n=500 Wilcoxon (C7 confirmed)\n\n### RC5: Novelty — prior work 是否已覆盖 phase-dependent sparsity\n- **��期质疑**: \"ThinKV and phase-aware methods already consider phase. What's new?\"\n- **应对**: Prior work 在单轴上分析 phase（ThinKV: phase-aware eviction）或 compound（SparK: joint compression）。没有工作同时分析 compound × phase × strategy 的三维交互。Crossover 现象（同一 strategy 在不同 phase 方向反转）��全新发现。Related Work 加 Lethe 引用区分 + SparK 对比。具体��分：\n  - **ThinKV** (arxiv 2510.01290, Oct 2025): 在 KV cache 单轴上做 phase-aware 压缩（�� CoT 阶段差异化 eviction），但不涉及 pruning × eviction 的 compound interaction。我们研究的是双轴（head pruning × KV eviction）compound interaction 如何随 phase 变化，ThinKV 的单轴 phase-aware 策略是我们分析维度的子集。\n  - **Physics of KV Cache Compression** (arxiv 2603.01426, Mar 2026): 揭示了单轴 KV 压缩的 phase transition 和 representational rigidity，是机制层面最接近的工作。关键区分：他们刻画的是单一压缩轴上压缩率的 critical threshold（phase transition），我们刻画的是两种压缩方法的 compound interaction severity 如何被 reasoning phase 调制（phase-dependent gradient）——维度正交。\n  - **HIES** (arxiv 2510.13832, Oct 2025): 发现 importance score collapse 并提出 entropy 补偿，为我们的 discrimination collapse 机制提供独立 supporting evidence——他们在单轴上观察到的 score collapse 正是我们在 compound setting 中发现的 Gini/CV 下降的单轴对应。\n  - **R-KV** (arxiv 2505.24133, May 2025): 针对 reasoning task 做 KV compression 优化，属于 task-specific method。我们不是提出新方法，而是 mechanistic 分析 compound interaction 的 phase-dependent 行为，二者目标不同（optimization vs understanding）。\n- **实验支撑**: C3 (crossover), Related Work §2 的 gap 分析\n\n### RC6: Novelty vs Lethe/SparK\n- **预期质疑**: \"How does this differ from Lethe (AAAI 2026) which also does layer-time-adaptive KV pruning, or SparK which studies compound compression?\"\n- **应对**: Lethe 和 SparK 都没有分析 phase × strategy 的交互效应。Lethe 是 method paper（提出 adaptive eviction 方法），我们是 empirical finding paper（发现 phase-dependent severity gradient）。SparK 研究 compound compression 但将 interaction 视为均匀超可加，我们发现 interaction severity 随 phase 和 strategy 变化。新近工作进一步确认我们的独特定位：\n  - **Physics of KV Cache Compression** (arxiv 2603.01426, Mar 2026) 是最近的相关工作，研究单轴压缩�� phase transition 阈值行为。与我们的核心区别：他们的 phase transition 是压缩率维度上的 critical point，我们的 phase-dependent gradient 是 reasoning phase 维度上 compound interaction 的连续调制——两者刻画的 \"phase\" 语义不同（compression-rate phase vs reasoning phase）。\n  - **ThinKV** (arxiv 2510.01290, Oct 2025) 和 **R-KV** (arxiv 2505.24133, May 2025) 都在 KV compression 单轴上引入 phase/reasoning awareness，但均未涉及 compound interaction。我们的贡献在于揭示 pruning × eviction 双轴交互如何被 reasoning phase 调制，这是单轴方法无法观察到的涌现现象。\n  - **HIES** (arxiv 2510.13832, Oct 2025) 的 importance score collapse 发现为我们的 discrimination collapse 机制提供了独立佐证，但 HIES 聚焦于单轴补偿方法，未研究 collapse 在 compound setting 中的放大效应。\n  - Related Work §2 明确区分三者定位：Lethe/SparK = method/compound method, ThinKV/R-KV = single-axis phase-aware, Physics of KV = single-axis phase transition, HIES = single-axis collapse。我们 = compound × phase × strategy 三维交互分析。\n- **实验支撑**: 不需要额外实验，仅需 §2 引用区分\n\n## Paper Positioning\n\n**类型**: Empirical finding paper（非 method paper）\n**核心贡献**:\n1. 发现 compound sparsity severity 的 strategy × phase 交互\n2. 量化 severity gradient（bf16 paired median difference 0.39→8.48, Cohen's d 0.61→1.13）和 crossover 现象\n3. 提出 discrimination collapse 机制解释（Gini/CV 跨模型一致；entropy redistribution model-dependent）\n4. Cross-model + cross-architecture (LLaMA, n=250) replication 验证泛化性（三模型两架构；strategy×phase 交互强度 architecture-dependent, D060）\n5. Novel use of scoring-independent eviction (recency-based) as methodological control — experimental design contribution 排除 phase segmentation circularity 和 scoring pathway confound (C11)\n\n**投稿目标**: EMNLP 2026 ARR, deadline 2026-05-25\n**Rebuttal 准备**: Day 9 (2026-05-23) 预留 rebuttal letter 写作时间\n**关���时间线**：\n- Day 9 (2026-05-23): 预留写 rebuttal letter\n- Day 11 (2026-05-25): EMNLP 2026 ARR 截稿\n","numLines":96,"startLine":1,"totalLines":96}}}
